<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EZK" style="id">Ezekiela</book>
  <para style="h">Ezekiela</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezekiela</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezekiela</para>
  <para style="mt">Ezekiela</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sawmthum kum thla lina, tahrik ni nga niin Kebar lui kama Juda-ho saltâng zînga ka awm ve laiin vân a inhawng a, Pathian inlârna ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chumi thla tahrik ni nga ni, Lal Jehoiakina an man kum nga kum chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kei, puithiam Ezekiela, Buzia fapa hnênah Babulon rama Kebar lui kamah chuan Lalpa thu chu a lo thleng ta a, Lalpa kut chu ka chungah a fu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka han en a, hmâr lam aṭangin thlipui a lo thawk chûk chûk a; chhûm dum kuihah chuan kâwl a phe zawr zawr a, a vêl chu a êng uau va, a phêtnaah chuan dar tle ang êng a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu êng lo chhuak aṭang chuan thilnung ang, mihring ang hi, pali an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmai pali leh thla pali an nei ṭheuh va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />an ke chu an thluang ngîl a, an ke bâwr chu bâwng ke ang hi a ni a, dâr nawh tlêt ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmai pali leh thla pali bâkah an panga thla pali hnuaiah chuan kut, mihring kut ang hi, an nei ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An thla chu inkhawih pha chiaha zârin kil li neiin an ding kual a, an kal pawhin inher ngai lovin mahni hma zâwnah an kal thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An hmêl lan dân chu hetiang hi a ni: Hma lamah mihring hmêl an pu a, ding lamah sakeibaknei hmêl, vei lamah bâwngpa hmêl, hnung lamah mupui hmêl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An hmêl chu chutiang chu a ni: an thla pahnih chu inkhawih pha ṭheuhvin an zâr kual a, an thla pahnih chuan an taksa an khuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An duhna lam lamah inher lovin an kal thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thilnungte chu meivâm, meialh êng tak ang hi an ni. Thilnung pali kârah chuan kâwl a phe zawr zawr a, mei angin a êng pup a. Mei aṭang chuan kâwlphe chu a lo de chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thilnung palite chu kâwlphe anga chakin an tlân tawn zawk zawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thilnung palite chu ka en reng lai chuan, an bul ṭheuhvah tawlailîr ke pali, leia innghat ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tawlailîr kete chu berul lung anga tle, inang ṭheuh a ni; a ke kual chhûnga ke kual dang awm ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An lirh sawn chuan inher lovin khawi lam zâwng pawhin an lîr thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tawlailîr ke bial tlâng chu a kual kung mai a, chhun kalhna a awm fur bawk a, a kual chu a de sût vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thilnungte kal duhna apiangah, an bulah chuan an lîr ve zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thilnungte an thlawh chhoh leh an chho ve a, thilnungte thu thuin an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An kalna lam apiangah an lîr ve zêl ṭhîn, an din leh an ding ve a, lei ata an chhoh leh tawlailîr kete pawh chu an chho ve a, thilnungte thu thu-a awm an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thilnungte lu chungah chuan thil kûmkulh hi a awm a, vûr anga vâr sût a ni, an lu chungah chuan a inzâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chu thil kûmkulh hnuaiah chuan an thla pahnih chu inkhawih phain an zâr duai a, an thla pahnih dang chuan an taksa an khuh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An han thlawh chuan tuifinriat thâwm anga nasa, Engkimtitheia aw ang, bûka mipui ri mur mur ang hian a ri hum hum a, an din chuan an thla chu an khup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An dina an thla an khup pawh chuan kumkulh aṭang chuan a la ri ta hum hum tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An lu chunga kûmkulhah chuan lalṭhutthlêng ang, safir lunga siam ni âwm hi a awm a, mihring ang hi a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A kâwng chung lam chu dâr rawh lin anga tle a ni a, a hnuai lam pawh chu mei anga êng a ni, a vêl chu a êng pum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A vêlin êng chu ruah sûr nia chhimbâl zâm ang pup hi a ni. Hei hi a ni Lalpa ropuina êng lan dân chu. Chu chu ka han hmuh chuan ka tlu bawkkhup a, min betu aw chu ka hre ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi betu chuan, “Mihring fapa, ding teh, i hnênah thu ka sawi dâwn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ṭawng veleh ka chhûngah Thlarau a lo lût a, min dintîr a, a thu sawi chu ka ngaithla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, hel hmang Israel fate chu ka chungah an hel a, an hnênah ka tîr dâwn che a ni. An pate aṭangin vawiin thlengin ka chungah thil sual an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An fate pawh tihmawh tak, luhlul tak an ni. An hnênah ka tîr a che: ‘Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti,’ i ti dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, hnam hel hmang tak ni mah se, an ngaithla emaw, ngaithla lo emaw, an zîngah zâwlnei a awm tih an hre dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, nang chuan anni chu hlau suh, an thu avângin zâm hek suh ang che. I thu an awih lo vang a, an kalh ang che, khawmualkaikuang zînga awm ang mai i ni ang. Hel hmang tak an ni a, vau dai che suh se, an hmêl chu hlau hek suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hel hmang tak ni mah se, an ngaithla emaw, ngaithla lo emaw, ka thu hi hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tin, mihring fapa, nang chu anmahni angin hel ve suh, ka sawi hi ngaithla la, i ka âng la, ka thil pêk che hi lem rawh,” mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kut hian mi rawn ban a, lehkhabu zial a keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kut chuan lehkhabu zial chu a phelh a, a chhûng lam leh pâwn lam chu ziakin a khat vek a. Thu chuang chu ṭahna thu te, rûmna thu te a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, lehkhabu zial i hmuh hi ei la; tichuan, kal la, Israel chhûngkaw hnênah thu va sawi ang che,” mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka kâ chu ka âng a, lehkhabu zial chu mi eitîr ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, lehkhabu zial ka pêk che hi lem la, puar takin ei rawh,” mi ti a. Tichuan, ka ei ta a, khawizu ang maiin a thlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel chhûngkaw zîngah kal la, ka hrilh apiang che hi va hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ṭawng harsa tak leh i hriat loh ṭawng hmang hnam hnênah ka tîr lo che, Israel-te hnênah a ni ka tirh che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭawng harsa tak leh i hriat loh ṭawng hmang hnam hnênah tîr che ni ila, i thu an lo ngaithla mahna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel-te hi zawngin i thu an ngaithla lo vang, ka thu pawh an ngaithla duh ṭhîn lo va ni. Israel-te hi mi deh khirh tak leh luhlul tak an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai teh, nang pawh anni ang bawka mi dehkhirh leh luhlul takah ka siam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meilung chang tak aia dehkhirhah ka siam dâwn a che. Hel hmang tak ni mah se, anni chu hlau suh la, an hmaah zâm hek suh ang che,” min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka hnênah thu a sawi zêl a, “Mihring fapa, ka hrilh tûr che hi ngun takin ngaithla la, vawng tlat rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tho la, i chipui, saltâng-ho hnênah kal la, an ngaithla duh emaw, duh lo emaw, an hnênah, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti va ti ang che,” min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, Thlarauvin mi chawi kâng a, hnung lamah chuan, ‘ Lalpa , ropui taka chu, a chênna aṭangin fak rawh u,’ tia an au hluah hluah chu ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thilnung pali thla hmâwr inkhawih phaa an thlâwk thâwm leh tawlailîr tlân thâwm ri hum hum chu ka hre bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Thlarau chuan min chawi kâng a, min hruai ta a. Ka hreh hle a, ka thin pawh a rim ṭeuh va. Mahse, Lalpa chuan min hruai lui tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kebar lui kam, Telabib hmuna awm saltângte hnênah chuan min hruai a. An ṭhutnaah chuan ka ṭhu ve a, ni sarih chhûng chu hrilhhai takin ka ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ni sarih a ral hnu chuan Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel chhûngkaw tân vêngtuah ka ruat a che. Ka thu i hriat hunah Israel-te chu min zilhsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi sual hnênah, ‘I thi ngei tûr a ni,’ ti ila, nangin i zilh lohva a nun theih nân a thil sual tih chu sim tûra i hrilh hmasak si loh chuan, chu mi chu a sual avâng chuan a thi ngei ang; mahse, a thihna mawh chu i chungah ka nghat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chu mi chu i lo hrilh lâwka, a sualna a sim duh lohva a sual luih zêl chuan a sualna avângin a thi ang a; nang erawh chu a thihna mawh lakah i fihlîm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi dik pawh, hawi kîrin thil sual ti sela, a tlûkchhiatna tûra ka tih chin a dai chuan a thi ang; nangin i zilh lo va, a sual avâng chuan a thi dâwn a ni, a thil ṭha tih ṭhinte chuan sâwtna a nei lo vang a, a thihna mawh chu i phur ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangin mi ṭha chu sual ti lo tûrin i zilha, thil sual a tih loh chuan i zilhna a pawm avângin a nung ngei ang, i zilhna a ngaithla a, nang pawhin i tuar lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mi rawn chelh ta tlat a, ka hnênah, “Tho la, lui phaizâwlah sâwn va kal teh; tah chuan thu ka hrilh ang che,” min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, ka tho va, lui phaizâwlah chuan ka kal ta a; Lalpa ropuina, Kebar lui kama ka hmuh ang kha a lo awm a, bawkkhupin ka tlu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thlarau chu ka chhûngah a lo lût a, min dintîr a, min bia a, “Kal la, inchhûngah inkhârhnan rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang, Mihring fapa, phuar kawm tlat i ni ang a, an zîngah i lêng chhuak thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I lei chu i dangah ka tibet ang a, i ṭawng thei lo vang a, anni chu i zilh thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />I hnêna thu ka sawi hunah i kâ chu ka hawnsak che ang a, Lalpa P athian -in sawi tûra ka hrilh che chu an hnênah i sawi dâwn nia. A duh chuan an ngaithla ang a, a duh lo chuan an ngaithla lo vang, hel hmang an ni si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Nang, mihring fapa, leirawhchan phêk la la, i hmaah phah rawh; tah chuan Jerusalem khawpui lem ziak la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />khaw hual angin cheibâwl la, phen tûr te siam la, lei te chhûng pâwng la, bûk sa la, bang chhut chhiatna te bun rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thîr phêk la la, khaw lem nêna in inkârah chuan chhawng ang che; khaw lem chu hawi la, i hual dâwn nia, Israel-te tân entîrna i ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tin, i vei lam delhin mu la, Israel-te sual mawh ka phurhtîr dâwn che a ni. I mut chhûngin Israel-te sual hremna i tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An kum khat sual aiah ni khat ka tuartîr ang che; ni zathum leh sawmkaw chhûng Israel-te sual chu i tuar dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan i ding lam delhin mu leh ang che, ni sawmli chhûng Juda-te sual i tuar leh ang, an kum khat sual aiah ni khat i tuar tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem chu hmachhawnin i hual ang a, i kuttum vilik la, a chhiat tûr thu hrilh mawlh mawlh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hual tûra ka tih chhûng che i tlingtlâk hma chu che sawn thei lovin ka phuar tlat dâwn che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huit leh barli te, be leh dailuah te, chhangphut te la la, bêlah dah khâwm ang che; ni zathum leh sawmkaw chhûng, i vei lam delha i mut chhûng zawng chuan chu chu chhangah siam la, i ring tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I duh hun hunah ni khat chhûngin gram zahnih leh sawmthum bûk chiah i ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tui pawh, i duh hun hunah ni khat chhûngin no hnih chin chiah i in thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chhangpêr i siam ang a, mihring êk ro mûtin i hem hmin ang a, an zaa hmuhah i ei dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Ka thawn darhna tûr rama mite zîngah Israel fate pawhin chutiang chuan chaw bawlhhlawh an ei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei chuan, “Khai a, Lalpa P athian , thil bawlhhlawh ka la ei ngai lo asin. Ka tleirâwl chhuah aṭangin a thisâwn leh a tlaw, sa rêng rêng ka la ei ngai lo, sa thianglo sa chu a tem pawh ka la tem ngai hlei nêm,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, ka hnênah, “En teh, mihring êk aiah bâwng êk ka pe ang che, chu chuan chhang chu i hem hmin dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka hnênah chuan a sawi zêl a, “Mihring fapa, ngai teh, Jerusalem khaw mite ei tûr, an chaw hmuhna hnâr chu ka chhu chat dâwn, an neih chhun chu bûk ker ker chauhvin thlaphâng takin an ei ang; tui pawh, hrilhhai takin a teh ker kerin an in ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ei tûr leh in tûr an tlachham ang a, hrilhhai takin an inen ang a, an sual avângin an râwp ral dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, lumêt mi bakmeh chem anga hriam khandaih la la, i lu leh i khabehmul ziat kâwng rawh. I ziah thlâk chu bûknaa bûkin sem rual rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem khua i hual hun chhûng a ral hun chuan hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu khuaah chuan meiah rawh ang che; hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu khaw pâwnah khandaihin sât sawm la, thli len darhtîr la, keiin khandaihin ka ûmzui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A dang chu i puan hmâwrah fûn la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a ṭhen chu la la, meiah vawm lût ang che; a kâng ang a, chuta ṭang chuan Israel hnam pum puiah mei a chhuak ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Aw nang, Jerusalem, khawvêla hmun laili takah ka dah che a, i vêlah hnam dangte chu ka awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thuruat i helsan a, ka Dânte i hnâwl a, i vêla hnam dang awmte aia nasa zâwkin ka thuruatte leh ka Dânte chu thil sual i tihsan a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan “Ka Dânte zâwm duh lovin i vêla hnam dang awmte aia nasa zâwkin thil sual i ti a; ka thununnate zâwm lovin i vêla awm hnam dangte dân i la zâwk a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, kei ngei pawh hian ka do dâwn che a ni. Hnam dangte hmuhah ka hrem ngei dâwn che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I thil tih tenawm tak takte avângin ka la tih ngai loh, tih leh pawh ka tum ngai loh i chungah ka ti dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In zînga pate chuan an fate sa an ei ang a, fate chuan an pate sa an ei bawk ang. Ka hrem dâwn che u a ni, a thi bâng pawh thli ka len darhtîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi nunga ka nih hi,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti. “In thil tih tenawm, ngeiawm tak tak avângin ka hmun thianghlim in tibawrhbâng a, kei ngei hian ka suat dâwn che u a ni; ka khawngaih lo vang che u a, ka dîm hek lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In zînga mi, hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chuan hripui leh ṭâm in thihpui ang a, hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat daipâwnah khandaiha sah hlum in ni ang. Hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu thli ka len darhtîr ang che u a, khandaihin ka ûmzui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutiang chuan ka thinur ka hrithla ang a, a dai tawh ang. Chumi hnu chuan Lalpa P athian -in ka ṭhahnemngaihna avângin chûng chu ka tih a ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“In vêla awmte leh veivâkte hmuhsit leh mak tihah ka siam bawk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thinur leh thinrim takin, lungawi lo zetin in chunga ro ka rêl zawh hnu chuan; mi hmuhsit, nuihzatbûr, mak tihah leh enthlâk in la ni ang; Kei Lalpa hian ka sawi tawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />In chhiat nân ṭâmpui mitthi ka tithleng ang a, in chaw hmuhna hnâr ka chhu chat ang a, rilṭâmin in thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ṭâm bâkah ram sakawlhte ka rawn tîr ang a, an seh ang che u a, lusûn in awm thliah thluah ang. Hripui leh thisen chhuahna, khandaih nên ka lêntîr bawk ang, in thi pheng phung ang: Kei Lalpa hian ka sawi hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel rama tlângte chu thlîr la, an chungthu sawi rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Israel rama tlângte u, Lalpa P athian thu hi ngaithla teh u: Tlâng te, mual te, ruam te leh luikawr te chungchâng thu-ah Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a sawi e: Ngai teh u, keimah ngei hian in chungah khandaih ka rawn lek dâwn; in hmunsângte chu ka tichhe vek ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />in maichâmte ka tichim ang a, in milim dinte chu a keh sawm ang; in zînga thite ruang chu in milem hmaah ka vawm khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel-ho fanaute ruang chu an biak milem bulah ka dah khâwm ang a, anmahni ruhte pawh an maichâm bulah ka theh darh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In chênna khua apiang chu ka tichim ang a, in hmunsângte chu a ṭhing reng ang; in maichâmte pawh a chim ang a, a ram dêr ang; in milemte chu a kehsawm zo vang a, in milim dinte chu ka chêk chhia ang a, in thiltihte chu nuai bo vek a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In zîngah mitthi ruang a let pheng phung ang a, a la damte chuan Lalpa ka nih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Ṭhenkhat chuan thih an pumpelh ang a, hnam dang zîngah, ram tinah ka tidarh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In zînga chutianga thih pumpelhte chu salah an man ang a, ram tinah an hruai darh ang. Hnam dang zînga an darh hnu chuan min hre chhuak ang a, uirea min hawisana, thil sual an tih pawi ka tih ṭhinzia te an hre chhuak ang a, milem lam an hawia, thil tenawm tak tak an lo tih ṭhin avâng chuan an inten ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei hi Lalpa chu ka lo ni ngei tih an hria ang a, ‘hêng thil hi ka ti ang’ ka tih kha ka ti mai mai lo tih pawh an hria ang,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti bawk: “I kutphah chûm la, i ke per rawh, Israel-ten thil sual tenawm an ti ṭhîn hi a va pawi êm! khandaiha sah hlum an ni ang a, hripui leh ṭâm tuarin an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ram hla taka awmte chu hripuiin an thi ang a, hnaivaia awmte chu khandaihin thah an ni ang. Heta la awm chhun, hual chhûnga awmte hi, rilṭâmin an thi ang, chutiang chuan ka thinur ka hrithla dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Milem hnêna rimtui an hâl ṭhinna, an hmunsângah te, tlâng chhîpah te, thingbuk hnuaiah te, sasaw buk hlimah te, an maichâm milem bulah te mitthi ruang a awm pheng phung hunah Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An chungah kut ka lek ang a, an chênna hmun tin mai chu Diblah thlalêr aia ram ro leh chhiaah ka siam ang a; tichuan; Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a. Lalpa P athian chuan Israel ram chungchâng thu a sawi a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nang, Mihring fapa, hun tâwp a lo thleng dâwn, ram chu a pumin a chhe vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tâwpna chuan a rawn nang ta che, ka thinur i chungah ka leihbua ang a, i thiltih ang zêlin i chungah ro ka rêl dâwn; thil tenawm tak tâk i tih avângin ka hrem dâwn a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka khawngaih lo vang chia, ka dim hek lo vang che. I tih ṭhin ang khân i chungah ka ti ang a, thil tenawm i tihte avângin ka hrem ang che; tichuan, Lalpa chu ka ni tih i hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Chhiatna hlîr, chhiatna hlîr a lo thleng dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hun tâwp, tâwpna ngei chu a lo hnai e, a lo kal a, a lo hnaih tâk saw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ram luahtute u, in chungah zângkhua a bungbu dâwn, tlânga hlim taka in zai ṭhîn ang kha ni lovin in râlkhêl dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thinurna chu in chungah ka sah dâwn a, ka thinrimna chu in tuar ang. In thil tih ang zêlin in chungah ro ka rêl ang a, in thil tenawm tih chu in chungah ka thungrûl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka khawngaih lo vang che u a, ka dim hek lo vang che u. In thil tih ang zêlin ka hrem ang che u a, thil tenawm in tihte chu in chungah ka thungrûl ang; tichuan, Lalpa chuan ka hrem che u a ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ngai teh, ni chu a lo thleng e, a lo thleng e, a lo inher chhuak ta, tuarna a punlun a, pawisak nei lo pawh an pung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Inpâwngnêkna chuan thil ṭha lo a tipung a, an neih eng mah bâng awm lo lêkin, an sum leh pai te, an thawhrim rah te, an nawmsakna te a ral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hun chu a lo thleng ta, thinurna chu mi tin chungah a tla dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sumdâwngtu chu a hlâwkna hmu hmanin a dam lo vang; he inlârna thu hian tu mah a hmaih lo vang, a kîr hek lo vang; an sual avângin tu mah dam khawchhuak an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tawtawrâwt an rawn hâm a, an inpeih ta vek a; mahse, lo do tûra thawk chhuak tûr tu mah an awm loh avangin an zaa chungah ka thinurna a tla ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pâwnah khandaihin a lo châng a, kulh chhûngah ṭâm leh hripui a lêng a, lova awm chu khandaihin an sât hlum ang. Khawpui chhûnga awmte chu hripui leh ṭâmin an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng pumpelh hrâmte chu tlângah, chul ram ṭhuro angin an rûm an rûm ang a, an sualna avângin an rûm chuah chuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An bân tha a ṭhum vek ang a, an khûpte a zâwi vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Saiip puan an veng ang a, hlauhnain an thâuvah a man ang; an zak êm êm ang a, an samte a tla kawlh vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An tangkate chu khawlaiah an paih ang a, an rangkachakte pawh thil bawlhhlawh ang a ni ang. Lalpa thinurna ni an chunga a lo thlen chuan an tangka leh rangkachak chuan a chhan thei lo vang a, anmahni titlutu a nih avângin ei tûr lei nân pawh an hmang thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An incheina mawi tak tak, an chhuan êm êm te chu an milem tenawm leh ngeiawm tak tak thuam nân an hmang a; chuvângin a ni thil bawlhhlawha ka chantîr tâk ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hnam dang ka mantîr ang a, khawvêla mi sualte tân râllâk sumah ka pe ang a, an tibawrhbâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka hawisan ang a, ka hmun thianghlim chu ka tibawrhbâng ang. Rûkru an lût ang a, an suam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Khaidiat buatsaih rawh u. Ram pumah thisen an chhuah a, khaw chhûngah pawh tharum an thawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuvângin, hnam azawnga hnam râwng ber ka rawn hruai ang a, in inte chu an rawn neihsak ang che u a, mi chapote chu ka titlâwm ang; in Hmun Thianghlimte chu an rawn tibawrhbâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thil râpthlâk lo thleng lakah chuan himna an zawng ang a, an hmu lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chhiatna tâwp ka thlen ang a, thu hlauhawm tinrêng ka tithang bawk ang; zâwlnei hnênah thil awmzia an zâwt ang a, puithiamte chuan zirtîr tûr an hre lo vang a, upate pawhin thurâwn tûr an nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal chu a lungngai ang a, miliante chu an hrilhhai ang a, ram chhûng mite chu an chau vek ang. An thiltih ang zêlin ka thungrûl ang a, an phû tâwk ang zêlin ka hrem ang; tichuan, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saltân kum ruk kum, thla rukna, tahrik ni nga ni chuan ka in chhûngah ka ṭhu a, Juda upaho ka hmaah an ṭhu a; tah chuan Lalpa P athian kut chu ka chungah a fu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka han en chuan mi, mei ang hi ka hmu a, a kâwng hnuai lam chu mei anga êng a ni a, a kâwng chung lam chu dâr tle anga tle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kut ni awm tak hian ka chhîpsamah mi rawn ṭhâm a, lei leh vân inkârah Thlarau chuan min chawi chho va. Pathian inlârnaah chuan Jerusalem-ah min hruai a, tualzâwl chhûng zâwk hmâr lam kawngkhârah chuan min dah a; tah chuan Pathian tithinurtu milem chu a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel-te Pathian ropuina, lui phaizâwla ka hmuh ang kha, a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hnênah chuan, “Mihring fapa, hmâr lam saw en teh,” mi ti a. Hmâr lam chu ka han en a, maichâm awmna hmâr lam kawngkhâr bulah chuan Pathian tithinurtu milem chu ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka hnênah chuan, “Mihring fapa, an thil tih hi i hmu maw? Israel chhûngten thil tenawm pui pui heta an tih hi i hmu em? Ka Tempul aṭangin mi dah pâwn tial tial a ni. Hei aia tenawm zâwk hi i hmu zêl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmun chhûng zâwk luhna kawngka bulah chuan min hruai a, bang pawp ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hnênah chuan, “Mihring fapa, bang pawp hi tizau rawh,” mi ti a. Ka han tihzau chuan kawngkhâr hi a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hnênah, “Lût la, heta thil sual tenawm an tih hi va en rawh,” min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, ka va lût a, thil tenawm pui pui, rûl lem te, ran lem te, Israel-te biak milem tinrêng, bangah chuan a lo chuang buai mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Safana fapa, Jazania hovin Israel upa rual sawmsarih an lo awm a, rimtui hâlna an keng ṭheuh va, an thil hâl khu chu a lo khat mup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel chhûngkaw upaten a rûka thil an tih hi i hmu em? Mahni pual ṭheuh milem an biak hi. ‘ Lalpa chuan mi hmu hlei nem, Lalpa chuan ram hi a chhuahsan tawh alâwm,’ an ti,” tiin min hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A sawi zêl a, “Thil tenawm lehzual an tih i hmu zêl dâwn,” min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmâr lama Lalpa in kawngkaah chuan min hruai leh a, tah chuan nuho an lo ṭap a, pathiannu Tamuz an lo ṭah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hnênah chuan, “Mihring fapa, hei hi i hmu maw? Hei aia tenawm zâwk an tih i la hmu ang” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa in hung chhûngnung zâwkah chuan mi hruai a, Lalpa Tempul kawngka bul, hulhliap leh maichâm inkârah chuan mi sawmhnih leh panga dâwn lai hi an lo awm a. Lalpa Tempul hnungchhawnin khawchhak lam an hawi a, khawchhak lama ni lo chhuak chu chibai lo zu bûk a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka hnênah chuan, “Mihring fapa, hei hi i hmu maw? Israel-te thiltih hi a tenau em ni? Ram chu pâwngnêknain an tikhat a, ka thin tiur zual tûrin hetah leh zêl hêng thil tenawmte hi an ti a ni. En teh, chhâwla an hnâr an huh vei saw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuvângin, kei pawh an chungah thinur takin ka ṭuan dâwn a ni, ka khawngaih lo vang a, ka dîm hek lo vang. Ring takin min au mah se ka hre duh bîk lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ring takin min ko va, “Khawpui enkawltute ko khâwm rawh, mi thahna tûr hriamhrei rawn keng teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmâr lama awm kawngkhâr chhakta zâwk aṭangin mi paruk, mi thahna tûr hriamhrei keng an lo kal a, an zînga pakhat chuan puan vâr a sin a, lehkhatui bûr a pai a, dâr maichâm bulah chuan an lo ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cherub-ho chunga awm ṭhîn, Israel-te Pathian ropuina chu a tho va, sumhmunah a lo chhuak a; puan vâr sin, lehkhatui bûr paitu chu a han ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “Jerusalem khawpui hi fang chhuak la, khaw chhûnga thil tenawm an tih pawiti a mangang ṭhînte chu an chalah chhinchhiah rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hriatah, mi dangte hnênah chuan, “Ama rual hian khua chu fang chhuak ve ula, kut thlâk rawh u; khawngaih suh ula, dîm hlek lovin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />putar te, tlangvâl te, nula te, naupang te leh hmeichhiate that fai vek rawh u, an chala chhinchhiahte chauh zuah rawh u. Ka Tempul aṭangin that ṭan rawh u,” a ti a. Tempul chhûnga upa awmho chu an that ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “Tempul chu tibawrhbâng ula, a tualzâwlah te mitthi ruang vawm khat rawh u,” a ti a. An kal a, khuaah chuan an che ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi an that lai chu keimah chauhvin ka en a, ka bawkkhup a, ka au va, “Jerusalem chunga i thinur avângin Israel mi la awm chhunte hi i that vek dâwn em ni?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hnênah chuan, “Israel-te leh Juda-te bawhchhiatna hi a nasa êm mai; ram chu tualthahnain an tikhat a, khawpui pawh hleih neihnain a khah tâk hi. ‘ Lalpan ram chu a kalsan a, eng mah a hmu tawh lo,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei pawhin ka khawngaih lo vang a, ka dîm hek lo vang; an thil tih ang ngeiin ka thungrûl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Puan vâr sin, lehkhatui bûr pai chuan, “Thu min pêk angin ka ti zo ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ka han en a, cherub-ho chunga kûmkulhah chuan safir lunga siam ni âwm tak, lalṭhutthlêng ang hi ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puan vâr sin kha a bia a, “Cherub hnuaia tawlailîr ke kârah sâwn kal la, cherub zînga meiling saw va ṭhûm la, khaw chhûngah theh darh rawh,” a ti a. A kal ta chu ka enzui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu mi chu a va kal chuan, cherub-ho chu Tempul chhûng chhim lamah an lo ding a, in chhûng chu meikhuin a khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa ropuina chu cherub chung aṭang chuan sumhmunah a chhuak a, in chhûng chu chhûmin a khat a, a tualah chuan Lalpa ropuina chu a êng phût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cherub-ho thla zâp thâwm chu tual hung pâwn aṭang pawhin hriat theih a ni a. El Sadaia thu sawi thâwm ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Cherub hnuaia tawlailîr ke zînga mei saw va la rawh” a han tih chuan puan vâr sin chu a kal a, tawlailîr ke bulah chuan a va ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cherub pakhat chuan cherub-ho hnuaia mei chu a la a, puan vâr sin chu a pe a; ani chuan a la a, a chhuahpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cherub-ho chuan an thla hnuaiah mihring kut ang hi an nei ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka han en chuan cherub bul ṭheuhvah chuan tawlailîr ke pakhat a lo awm thliah a; tawlailîr kete chu berul lung ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tawlailîr ke pali chu a inang ṭheuh va, a ke kual chhûnga ke kual dang awm ang mai hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An han lirh chuan inher lovin khawi lamah pawh an lîr thei, cherub hawina lam lamah, inher lovin an lîr thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An pumin, an taksaah te, an hnungzângah te, an kutah te, an thlaah te leh tawlailîr ke kualah te pawh mit a khat vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tawlailîr kete chu ‘vir vut vut’ an tiin ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An vaiin hmêl pali an nei ṭheuh va, cherub hmêl te, mihring hmêl te, sakeibaknei hmêl te leh mupui hmêl te a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cherub-ho, Kebar lui kama ka hmuh, thilnung palite kha, an thlâwk chho a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cherub-ho kalna apiangah tawlailîr kête pawh chu a lîr ve zêl a, cherub-ho an thlawh chhoh leh an rualin an chho ve zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cherub-ho an din chuan an ding ve a, an thlawh chhoh leh an chho ve a, cherub-ho thu thuin an awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa ropuina chu Tempul pindan hmasa aṭang chuan a chhuak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />cherub-ho thla zâp chu ka hmu a, an thlâwk chho va, tawlailîr kête pawh chu a tel zêl a; Lalpa in, khawchhak lam kawngkhâr chungah chuan an ding ta a, an chungah chuan Israel-te P athian ropuina chu a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chu chu Kebar lui kama Israel-te Pathian hnuaia thilnung ka hmuhte chiah kha an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hmai pali leh thla pali an nei ṭheuh va, an thla hnuaiah mihring kut ang an nei bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An hmêl pawh chu Kebar lui kama ka hmuh ang chiah kha a ni, an kalna lam apiang chu an hma zâwn a ni ṭheuh thei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thlarau chuan mi chawi kâng a, khawchhak lam panga Lalpa in kawngkhârah chuan min hruai a, kawngkhâr bulah chuan mi sawmhnih leh panga an lo awm a, an zîngah chuan mipui hotu Azura fapa Jaazania te, Benaia fapa Pelatia te an awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hnênah chuan, “Mihring fapa, hêng mite hi an ni, thil sual ngaihtuah chhuaka, khuaa mite fuih khawlo zotute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In sak a la hun lo, ‘khawpui hi sa bêl ang a ni a, keini hi sa ang kan ni, kan him a nih hi,’ an ti a; chuvângin, aw nang, Mihring fapa, an chungchâng tûr thu hi sawi rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa Thlarau chu ka chungah a lo thleng a, ka hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Sawi rawh, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘In thu sawite chu ka hria a, in thil tih tumte pawh ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khaw chhûngah mi in thah belh zêl a, tual laite chu mitthi ruangin a khah tâk hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Tuallaia in mi thah dah khâwmte chu sa bêl chhûnga sa awmte chu an ni; khua chu sa bêl a ni a; mahse, nangni chu ka la chhuak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In hlauh tak khandaih chu, in chungah ka rawn thlen dawn,’ Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khua ata ka la chhuak ang che u a, ram dang mite hnênah ka pe ang che u, ka hrem dâwn che u a ni, khandaiha sah hlum in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In ramri chhûng ngeiah in chungah ka ṭuan ang; tichuan, Lalpa ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sa bêl chhûnga sa a him ang hian khua chuan a humhim lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka thupêkte chu in awih duh lo va, ka dânte pawh in zâwm duh hek lo. In chhehvêla awm hnam dangte dân chu in la ta zâwk si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chûng thu ka sawi lai chuan Benaia fapa Pelatia chu a tlu a, a thi ta mai a. Ka bawkkhup a, ring takin, “Aw Lalpa P athian , Israel-ho la awm chhunte hi i tiboral vek dâwn em ni?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Jerusalem mite chuan, i unau, i laichîn, i chipui Israel saltângte chu, ‘ Lalpa in an pawh pha ta lo, ram chu kan chan atân min pe vek tawh,’ an ti vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvângin, an hnênah sawi rawh: ‘Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Hnam dang zîngah ka awmtîr daih a, ram tinah ka tidarh nâ a, an hnênah, an darhna ramah chuan, ka awm zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, hetiang hian hrilh rawh: Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Mi zîng ata ka hruai chhuak che u ang a, in darhna ram ata ka khâwm ang che u, Israel ram chu ka pe leh ang che u.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, an lo haw ang a, thil ngeiawm leh tenawm zawng zawng hi an rawn tibo vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lungrual takin ka awmtîr ang a, thinlung thar ka pe ang. An thinlung, lung anga sak chu, ka lak bosak ang a, thinlung nêm tak ka siamsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka thupêkte an awih ang a, ka Dânte chu an zâwm ang a, an ti zêl ang; ka mite an ni ang a, an Pathian ka ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hêngho, thil ngeiawm leh tenawm tak tak tih ngainatuho hi an thiltih ang zêlin ka rûl ang,” Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cherub-ho chu an thlâwk a, tawlailîrte pawh chuan an zui a, an chungah chuan Israel-te Pathian ropuina chu a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa ropuina chu Jerusalem khua aṭang chuan a chhuak a, khawpui chhak lam tlângah chuan a ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kei pawh inlârnaah chuan Thlarauvin min chawi a, Kaldai ram saltângte hnênah min hruai a, inlârna ka hmuh chu a kiang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa thil min hmuhtîr zawng zawng chu saltângte ka hrilh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, hel hmang zînga awm i nih hi; mit an nei a, an hmu thei si lo; beng an neia an hre thei hek lo; an hel lui zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, nang, Mihring fapa, saltâng thawmhnaw ang têl la, khaw ên laiin an hmuh ngeiah saltâng tûr angin thawk chhuak rawh, hmun dangah kal la, hel hmang tak ni mah se an hmu mahna che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An hmuh ngei tûrin chhûnah saltâng thawmhnaw têl la, tlaiah saltâng tûr anga i chhuak chu hmu ngei che rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An hmuh ngei tûrah bang chu ṭhiat la; tah chuan la chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An hmuh ngeiah pu la, thimah chhuahpui rawh, kawng i hmuh theih loh nân i mit khuh ang che; Israel-te tân chhinchhiahnaah ka siam dâwn che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thu min pêk ang chuan ka ti a, chhûnah saltâng thawmhnaw ang ka têl a, tlaiah, thim dâwnah, bang ka ṭhiat a, ka la chhuak ta a. Min en huai huai a, thawmhnaw têl chu ka pu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tûk zîngah chuan Lalpa chuan ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, hel hmang Israel chhûngte chuan, ‘Eng nge i tih?’ an tih che chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />an hnênah heti hian ti ang che: ‘Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: He thu hi Jerusalem rorêltu leh khuaa awm zawng zawng tân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In tân chhinchhiahna ka nih hi: ka tih ang tak hian in chungah an ti ang; sala tâng tûrin an man ang che u.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“In hotu chu thawmhnaw têl puin thimah a tlân chhuak ang, an chhuahna tûr bang an rek pawp ang a; tah chuan a chhuak ang, kawng a hmuh theih loh nân a mit a khuh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tân lên ka zâr ang a, a âwk ang a, Kaldai ramah, Babulon khuaah ka hruai ang; chu khua chu a mit chuan a hmu lo vang; mahse, tah chuan a thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah puitu, a ṭhuihruai zawng zawng, a vêngtu sipaite nên thli ka lentîr ang a, khandaihin ka ûmzui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hnam dang zînga ka thawn darha, ram tina ka tihdarh hnu chuan Lalpa chu ka lo ni ngei tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khandaih te, hripui te, ṭâm avâng tea thi bâng mi tlêm tê ka zuah ang; an kalna hnam tin zîngah thil tenawm tak an tih ṭhinte chu an hre chhuak ang a, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, khûr chungin chaw ei la, mangang taka sai dawt dawtin tui in rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />He rama mite hi hrilh rawh: Israel rama Jerusalem khaw chungthu Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a sawi: ‘Mangang takin chaw an ei ang a, thlabâr chungin tui an in ang, a mi chêngte nun a râwng êm a,’ ram chu a ṭiau vek dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An chênna khawpuite chu a chim chhe vek ang a, ram pum chu a ram der ang. Tichuan, Lalpa ka ni tih an hria ang,” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel ramah, ‘Nikhua a lo rei a, hrilhlâwkna a thlâwn leh mai ṭhîn,’ in ti ṭhîn hi engtizia nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />He thu hi hrilh rawh: Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘ṭawng tuallêng lâr tak in neih hi ka tibâng dâwn, Israel ramah an hmang tawh lo vang.’ Hrilh rawh, hun a lo thleng ṭêp a ni, inlârnaa thil hmuh chu a thleng thuai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel-te zîngah inlârna lem leh hrilhlâwkna dik lo a awm tawh lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />‘ Lalpa chu ka ni a, ka sawi apiang chu hlen a ni ang; a muangchâng lo vang. Aw Israel helhmangte u, ka sawi hi in dam chhûng ngeiin hlen a ni ang, Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti,’ ti rawh,” mi ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, ngai teh, Israel chhûngte chuan, ‘Hun rei tak hnua mi tûr inlârna a hmu a, rei tak hnua thleng tûr chauh a hrilh lâwk ṭhîn,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuvângin, an hnênah sawi rawh: Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka thu sawi rêng rêng a muangchâng lo vang: ka sawi chu tih nghâl a ni ang, Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti, ti rawh,” min ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel rama zâwlnei, mahni phuahchawp sawi ṭhînte hnênah, ‘ Lalpa thu ngaithla rawh u,’ ti rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Mahni duhzâwng chauh leh an hmuh si loh thu sawi ṭhîn zâwlneite chu an chung a pik e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel-te u, in zâwlneite chu khaw ram sihal ang chauh an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel-te kulh bang chhe lai an vêng lo va, Lalpan indona a rawn tihthlen tûr laka him nân thawm an tum hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An thil hmuh chu dâwt mai mai a ni a, phuahchawp inlârna an hmu a. Lalpa sawi loh pui chu ‘ Lalpa thuchhuak a ni’ an ti a. An sawi chu a dikin an ring lehnghâl a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka sawi loh pui, ‘ Lalpa thuchhuak a ni,’ in tih hian inlârna lem in hmu a, phuah chawp in sawi mai mai tihna a ni lâwm ni?.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Dâwtin thu in sawi a, inlârna lem in hmu a; chuvângin, ka hua che u a ni,’ Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Zâwlnei, inlârna lem hmua, dâwt phuahchawp sawi chîngte chungah ka kut ka lek dâwn; ka mite ṭhu khâwm zîngah an tel ve lo vang a, Israel mite hming ziakna bu-ah an hming a chuang lo vang a, Israel ram an luah ve hek lo vang; tichuan, Lalpa P athian chu ka ni tih in hria ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mite chu, ‘A muanawm e,’ tiin in hruai sual a, a muanawm tawp si lo va, kulh bang chhetê an han rem a, rinawm âwm takin chinai nên an zût mâm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />chutianga zût mâmsaktute hnênah chuan, ‘A chim mai ang’ ti rawh. Ruah bawhawk a lo sûr ang a, rial lian pui puiin a rawn dêng ang a, thlipui a lo tleh ang a, a chim ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bang chu a chim hnuah, ‘In zût mâmna kha khaw nge a nih tâk?’ an la ti dâwn lâwm che u ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ka thinur avângin thlipui ka tlehtîr ang a, ka thinrim avângin ruah bawhawk ka sûrtîr ang a, min run êm avângin rial ka chhuttîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, chinai nêna in zût mawi chu a chim ang a, a lungphûm lam a lang rel rul ang a, a chim vek ang; nangni pawh in thi ang; tichuan, Lalpa ka ni tih tu pawhin an la hria ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tichuan, bang chungah leh chinaia zût mâmtute chungah ka thinur ka hrithla ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘A zût mâmtu, Jerusalem chungchâng, muanawm si lo muanawma hmutu Israel zâwlneite chu an thi a, bang pawh a awm tawh lo,’ tiin ka hrilh ang che u,” Lalpa P athian chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Nang, Mihring fapa, i mi, hmeichhehote hi hmachhawn rawh: an duhzâwng ang ang an sawi lâwk a, an chungthu heti hian sawi rawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Nangni, hmeichheho, in chung a pik e. In bânah dawi hrui in bun a, mi hîp nân lu khuhna in siam a, in sa him nân ka mite hi in veh in veh dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka mite dâwta bumin barli vei khat lek leh chhang ah khat lek avângin thi lo tûr tûr in tithi a, thi âwm tak tak in zuah thung a, min tihmingchhe nasa a ni.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘in bânbun, sava tawktarh anga mi in hîpna chu ka huatzâwng tak a ni. In bân aṭangin ka pawt thla ang a, sava anga in awhte chu ka chhuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />In inkhuhnate pawh ka pawtthlêr ang a, in kuta awm, ka mite chu, ka chhuah ang, in duh duha tih theih an ni tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tihmangan ka duh loh mi ṭhate chu dâwtin in tihṭhaih a, a nun theih nân mi sual chu a hawi kîr tûr kîr lo tûrin in fuihpawrh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuvângin, inlârna lem in hmuhte leh in hrilhlâwkna dik lote chu ka tihtâwpsak ang che u a, ka mite chu in kut ata ka chhan chhuak ang,’ ” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel upa ṭhenkhat an lo kal a, ka hmaah an ṭhu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, hêng mite hian milem an vuan tlat a, an bawhchhiatna chu an tân dâltu a ni a, min râwn tûr em an nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuvângin, heti hian hrilh rawh: ‘Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Israel mi tu pawh, milem vuan tlata, an bawhchhiatna chu anmahni dâltu ni ṭhîn mah se, zâwlnei râwn tûra an lo kal chuan, milem an ngah êm avângin kei Lalpa hian na takin ka lo chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel chhûngte hian an milem avângin min hawisan nâ a, an thinlung ka hmin theih nân ka lo chhâng dâwn a ni.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Chuvângin, Israel chhûngte chu hrilh rawh: ‘Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Lo kîr ula, in milemte hawisan ula, in thiltih tenawmte chu bânsan rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel chhûng zînga mi emaw, an zînga chêng vête emaw, milem vuan tlata, an bawhchhiatna dâltua hmanga, ka laka intihrangte, an chungchâng thu-a zâwlnei hmanga mi râwn tûra lo kal chu; Kei Lalpa , kei ngei hian ka chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka lo sawisa ang a, ka mite zîng ata ka theh chhuak ang. Miin an enbîk leh an sawi huai huai an ni ang a, Lalpa ka nih hi an hria ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tin, zâwlnei chu buma awmin thu a sawi chuan, chu zâwlnei bumtu chu keimah ka ni a, ka kut a chungah ka lek ang a, ka mi Israel-te zîng ata ka tiboral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zâwlnei sualna leh a râwntu sualna chu a inang reng a ni, an sual mawh chu anmahni ngeiin an phur ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel chhûngte chu ka hnên ata an kal bo tawh lo vang a, milem avângin an bawrhbâng hek lo vang a, an bawh chhiatna avângin an bawlhhlawh hek lo vang a, ka mite an ni tawh zâwk ang a, an Pathian ka ni ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a sawi zêl a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, ram chuan ka chungah nasa takin thil sual ti sela, ka kut ka lek ang a, an chaw hmuhna hnâr ka chhut chahsak ang a, rilṭâmin mihring leh sa an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Hêng mi ṭha pathum, Nova te, Danela te, Joba te hi awm ve mah se, an ṭhat avângin an nunna chauh an hum thei ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ram chhûngah ram sakawlh ka tirha, mi an seh hlum pheng phunga, rama mi an darh zawha, sa hlauh avânga kal ngam lohna hiala ka siamin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />hêng mi pathumte hi awm ve mah se, an fanu fapate pawh an chhan thei lo vang; anmahni an inhum thei hrâm chauh ang a, ram chu a chhe zo vang. P athian ka nih hi,” Mi nung Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ram chhûngah khandaih ka tirha, ‘Khandaihin ram hi fang chhuak sela, mi leh sa zawng zawng that rawh se,’ ka tih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />hêng mi pathumte hi awm ve mah se, an fanu fapate pawh an chhan thei lo vang, anmahni erawh chu an inhum thei hrâm ang. Pathian nung ka nih hi,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Mi leh sa tiboral tûra hripui ka lêntîra, ka thinurna ka leih buak chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nova te, Danela te, Joba te awm ve mah se, an fanu fapate pawh an chhan thei lo vang. Kei Lalpa , Pathian nung ka nih hi,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti: ‘An ṭhat avângin anmahni chu an inhum thei hrâm ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka hremna na tak tak pali - khandaih te, ṭâm te, hripui te, sakawlh te, mihring leh sa tiboral tûra Jerusalem-a ka tirh hun chuan a va râpthlâk dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An fanu fapate zînga thi bâng an awma, in hnêna an lo kal chuan, an khawsak dân leh an thil tihte chu in hmu ang a, Jerusalem chunga thil ṭha lo ka tih zawng zawng chu tih âwm rêng in ti ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An khawsak dân leh an thil tihte in hmuh hunah chuan ka thil tihte chu chhan ṭha tak awm lo chuan ka ti lo tih in hria ang a, a âwm in ti ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mi be leh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, grep hrui leh a ṭangte hi ngaw thing leh a ṭangte aiin eng nge a lêm chuanna?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“A kûng chu thil siam nân an hmangin A ṭang chu thil khai nân an siam ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai teh, meiah an tuah a, A hmâwr tuakah a alh a, A lai chu a kâng ût a, Ṭangkaina a nei tawh em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kan hma pawh khân Eng siam nân mah a tlâktlai lo va, A kan uh hnu phei chuan Eng atân mah hman tlâk a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ngaw thing zînga grep hrui chu Tuah tûrin thu ka pe a, Jerusalem khuaa chêngte pawh chutiang chuan ka ti ta.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kâng hmasa pumpelh mah se, Mei kângah ngei an ral ang. Ka sawisak hunah chuan Lalpa ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Min uiresan avângin Ram chu ka tiram vek dâwn a ni,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Jerusalem chu a thil tenawm tihte hi hrilh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem hnênah heti hian a ti: ‘I pian leh mûrna chu Kanan mite ram a ni a; i pa chu Amor mi, i nu chu Hit mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I pian lai khân i laihrui âttu i nei lo va, bual fai i ni hek lo, chi an hnawih lo che a, puanin an tuam hek lo che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu mah en ṭha duh che an awm lo va, lainat chein tu man an bawihsâwm lo che. I pian hlim bawlhhlawh ang angin tâmlakah an hnutchhiah che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka kal pahin thisen zînga i leng i leng chu ka hmu che a, chutia thisen zînga i awm chu i dam ka duh a, ‘I dam chhuak tûr a ni,’ ka ti che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnim ang maiin ka tiṭhang che a, i ṭhangduang ta hle a, i lian tulh tulh a, i hmêl pawh a ṭha deuh deuh va. I hnute te a lo um a, i sam te pawh a ṭha ta hle a; mahse, saruak mai i la ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka lo kal leh chuan ka han hmu che a, ngaihzâwng nei rual i lo ni ta a; tichuan, ka puan ka zâwn che a, i saruak chu ka khuhsak che a, ka ta i ni ta,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tin, tuiin ka bual che a, i thisen kaite chu ka sil fai a, hriak ka hnawih che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puan cheimawi ka sintîr che a, savun ṭha mi pheikhawk ka buntîr bawk che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thawmhnaw ṭha ṭha ka bel che a, ngûn i bun a, khaidiat mawi ka awrhtîr bawk che kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hnâr vuah ka vuahsak che a, bengbeh ka behtîr bawk che a, lukhum mawi tak ka pêk bawk che kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, tangka leh rangkachakin i inthuam a, puan vâr pan chi leh maimaw puan i sin a, puan cheimawi i bih bawk a. Chhangphut ṭha chi i ei a, khawizu te, hriak te duhtâwkin i tlân a; i hmêl pawh a ṭha ta hle a ni, lalnu ni âwm tak i lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I hmêlṭhatzia chu a thang huai huai a, ka mawina ka bel che avângin i ṭha famkim a ni,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mahse, i hmêlṭhat chu i chhuang a, i hmingthan chu i hur phah ta a, lo kal apiang hnênah i inphalrai a, an tlâwm ta che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I inthuamnate chu i hlîp a, hmunsâng i siam a, puan rawng chi hrang hrang nên i inchei a, tah chuan i inzuar ta a. Chutiang chu a la thleng ngai lo va, a awm leh ngai hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tangka leh rangkachak ka pêk che khân mipa lem i siam a, mi hur angin i khawsakpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thawmhnaw cheimawi ka pêk che chuan milem chu i thuam a, hriak leh rimtui ka pêk che chu an hmaah i hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chhangphut ṭha chi te, hriak te, khawizu tein ka châwm che a, chûng chu milem tlawn nân an hnênah i hlân a, chutiang chuan i ti ṭhîn,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Chulovah pawh, ka tâna i hrin, i fanu fapate hâlral atân an hnênah i hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hur theuleu tâwk ti lova, ka fate leh zêl milem hmaa hâl ral tûra i hlan hi thil namên em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hêng thil tenawm hi tia i hur tak êm avângin, i naupan lai, saruak mai i nih lai, thisen zînga i leng i leng laite kha i hre ta lo a nih hi le!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “I chung a pik e, i chung a pik e, hêng thil sual i tih bâkah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />kawng sîrah milem biakna leh inzawrhna tûr i siam thliah thluah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kawng langsâr laiah chûng hmunsâng chu i sa a, i hmêlṭhat chu i titenawm a; lo kal apiang i mal i hlîmsak zêl a, nawhchizuar satliah pawh i nih loh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I ṭhenawm, Aigupta, taksa lian pui pui hnênah i inhralh a, mi tithinur tûrin i hur a zual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngai teh, i chungah kut ka lek ta. I chanpual ṭhîn chu ka hnûk kîr ta; nangmah hawtu, i khawloh zahpuitu Filistia mite hnênah ka pe ta che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chu chu duh tâwk lovin Asuria-ho hnênah pawh i inzuar a, i inphalrai a; mahse, i kham chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Babulon mi, sumdâwngho hnênah pawh i inphalrai a, i kham chuang hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zah bosal tawh nawhchizuar ang maiin i chêt hi, i va hur teh hiam êm!” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kawng aṭanga langsâr laiah milem biaknate i siam a, kawtthlêr tinah inzawrhna hmun i nei a; mahse, nawhchizuar pawisa mamawh ang hi i ni ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mahni pasal hmangaih lova uiresana, mi dang daih pawm ta ang hi i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nawhchizuarte hi chuan hlawh an nei ṭhîn, nang erawh chuan mutpuitu che hlawh i pe thung a, ram hla tak taka mi i ṭhâm khâwm hlawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nawhchizuar danglam tak i ni, miin an sâwm lo che a, nangin i sâwm thung a; hlawh an pe lo che a, nangin i pêk thung hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nang mi hurnu, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “I bawlhhlawh êm mai, i ngaihzâwngte i hurpuina lamah i saruakna a lang zo ta: thil tenawm milemte i bia a, i fate thatin an hnênah i hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chuvângin, i ngaihzâwng rual, i tlawn hawm hawmte leh i huatzâwngte pawh ka ko khâwm ang a, kil tina din hual tûr chein ka hruai khâwm ang. An hmaah ka hlîm ang chia, an hmu fai leuh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pasal uiresantu leh tualthattu chungthu an rêl ang hian i chungthu ka rêl ang. Min run êm avângin thinur takin i chungthu ka rêl dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />An kutah ka pe ang chia, hmunsâng leh inzawrhna hmun i siamte chu an tichhe vek ang; i silhfênte an hlihsak ang chia, i thil mawite chu an la ang a, saruakin an dah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tlâng an pun ang a, lungin an dêng ang chia, ngûnhnâmin an chhun ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />I inte chu an hâl ang a, hmeichhe dang hmuhah an hrem ang che; i hurna ka titâwp ang a, i ngaihzâwngte chu thilpêk i pe leh tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tichuan, ka thinur chu a dai ang a, min run êmna chu a reh ang a, ka ngawi tawh ang, ka thinrim tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />I têt lai kha i hriat reng tawh loh avâng leh hêng thil i tih ṭhinte hian min tihnat êm avângin ka thungrûl ang che,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti. “Thil tenawm tinrêng tih belhchhahin i hur mualpho zêl a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ngai teh, he ṭawng tuallêng tak hi hmangin, ‘nu siar, nu siar’ an ti lut lut dâwn che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />I nu, mahni pasal leh fate ngeitu fanu ngei zawng i lo nih tak hi; mahni pasal leh fate ngeitu laizâwn i lo ni a. I nu chu Hit mi a ni, i pa chu Amor mi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />I u Samaria chu a fanute nên, i ram hmâr lamah a awm a. I nau Sodom chu a fanute nên, chhim lamah a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />An awm dân anga awm ve lovin an thiltih tenawmte chu i ti ve ngai lo va; mahse, tûn maiah khân an aia hluar zâwkin i khawsa ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: “P athian nung ka nih hi, i nau Sodom tih ngai loh, a fate pawhin an tih ngai loh, nang chuan i fate nên in tih tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ngai teh, i nau Sodom sualna chu hei hi a ni: a chapo va, ei tûr a ngahin a fanute nên nuam an chên der der a, retheite leh mangangte an chhawmdâwl ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />An inchhuang êm êm a, ka hmaa thil tenawm an tih avângin ka nuai bo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Samaria pawhin i thil sual tih chanve pawh a ti lo, an aia nasa zâwkin thil tenawm i ti a; i thil tih a tenawm êm avângin i u thil tenawm tih chu a lan nêp tâk zâwk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />I laizâwnte aia thil tenawm i tih nasat zâwk avângin an tuar âwma i ngaih aia nasa zahna i tuar ang; an aia i sualna a tenawm zâwk avângin anni chu ṭha viau âwmin an lang a ni; zakin sen awp awp rawh, i laizâwnte zawng mi ṭha tak ni âwm in an lan tâk hial hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />“Sodom leh a fate chu ka din chhuahtîr leh ang; Samaria leh a fate pawh ka din chhuahtîr leh ang; an rual chuan nang pawh ka din chhuahtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />I la inzahpui ang a, i thiltihte avângin i la zak hle ang, anni pawh an ngaih a ṭha sawt ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />I nau Sodom leh i u Samaria chu an fate nên an ngai an awh leh ang; nang pawhin i fate nên ngai in awh leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />I ṭhat lai khân i nau Sodom chu kamchhe tleuhna takah i hmang ṭhîn a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />I sualzia a lang ta a, anni ang bawk i ni, i vêla awm, Edom leh Filistia leh an faten, nangmah hawtute chuan, an hmuhsit ve tâk che hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />I thiltih tenawm leh i hurna hi a mawh chu i phur dâwn a ni,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “I tih angin ka thungrûl ve ang che; i thutiam ngainêpin thuthlung chu i bawhchhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Mahse, kei chuan i naupan laia i hnêna ka thuthlung kha ka hre reng ang a, kumkhaw thuthlung ka siamsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />I awm dân kha i hre chhuak ang a, i laizâwn, i u leh i naute chu i pawm leh hunah i la zak hle ang; ka thuthlungah tel lo mah se anni chu i fa atân ka pe dâwn che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Nang nêna ka thuthlung chu ka tinghet ang a, Lalpa chu ka ni tih i hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />I thil sual tihte ka ngaihdam hunah chuan i sual ṭhinzia kha i hre chhuak ang a, i inzahpui êm êm avângin eng mah i sawi ngam lo vang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian mi rawn hrilh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel-te hnênah thu khirh leh tehkhin thu sawi rawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Mupui lian tak, thla hlai pui nei, Fêp buk mawi tak nei chu Lebanon tlângah a lo thlâwk a, Sidar lêrah a fu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A lêr zîkno chu a thliak a, Sumdâwng mi ramah a thlawhpui a, Sumdâwnna khawpuiah a phun ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel rama grep ṭang a la bawk a, Lei ṭha hmunah a phun a, Tui tamna hmunah chuan a tlar a, Tuipuisuthlah ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lo ṭhang a, grep buk hniam ṭawi tak a lo ni a, A zârte chuan mupui lam chu a pan a, A zung chu lei thûk takah a zâm lût a. Tichuan, grep chu a lo chawr buk ta luai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mupui lian tak dang a awm a, Thla hlai tak leh fêp buk tak a nei bawk a, A ṭo hmun ata grep zung leh zâr chuan, Tui a hmuh tam zâwk theih nân a lamah a zâm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ram ṭha tak, tui tamnaah Grep kûng lian tak, duah hluah Rah tup tûra phun sawn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: A puitling thei dâwn em ni? A phuntu chuan a zung chu pawt phawiin A rahte chu paihin A chawrnote chu a tivuai mai lâwng maw? Pawt phawi tûrin mi tam tak emaw, Mi chak tehchiam emaw a ngai si lo va?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngun taka phun zawng a ni ngei mai a, Mahse, a nung thei dâwn em ni? Khawchhak thliin a rawn chhêm ang a, A uai-in a ṭona hmunah chuan A vuai mai dâwn lâwm ni?’ Ti rawh,” min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian mi hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hel hmang chhûngte chu hrilh rawh. He thil awmzia hi an hre lo vem ni? Ngai teh, Babulon lal chu Jerusalem-ah a lo kal a, lal leh miliante a man a, Babulon-ah a kawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal fa zînga pakhat chu thu a thlunpui a, chhia a chhamtîr a; milian dangte chu a hruai bo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ram chu a tlâwm a, an inlek leh loh nân leh thuthlung an bawhchhiat loh nân chûng miliante chu a hrêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mahse, a hel ta a, Aigupta ramah sakawr leh sipai tam tak dîl tûrin palai a tîr a; a hlawhtling ang em? Chutiang titu chu a him dâwn em ni? Thuthlung bawhchhetu chu a inhum thei dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘Mi nung ka nih hi,’ ” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti. Lala dahtu Babulon lal hnêna a chhechham leh thuthlung a bawhchhiat avângin chu lal chu Babulon-ah a thi ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi tam tak tihlum tûra lei an chhûn pâwna, hual bang an siam hnan hnuah chuan Farawa sipai huaisente leh a ṭhuihruaite chuan an chhan thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A chhechham chu a ngaihthah a, thuthlung chu a bawhchhia a, bân phar meuhva a nemngheh tawh si chu bawhchhiaa hêng thil hi a tih tak avângin a him lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Mi nung ka nih hi; ka thutiam a hmusit a, ka thuthlung a bawhchhe vei a, ama chungah ngei ka ṭuan dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lênin ka khuh ang a, ka thangah ka awhtîr ang a, Babulon-ah ka hruai ang. Tichuan, mi phatsan avângin a chungthu ka rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A sipai tlân darhte chu khandaiha sah hlum an ni ang a, a thi bangte chu kil tin kil tangah an darh ang. Chûng sawitu chu kei, Lalpa hi ka ni tih in hria ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Kei hian sidar thing sâng ziding Zîkno chu ka thliak ang a, Keimah ngeiin tlâng sâng zo takah ka phun ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel tlâng sângah chuan ka phun ang a, A duahin a rah tup ang. Sidar thing lian tak a ni ang a, a buk hlimah chuan Sava tinrêng an chêng ang a, bu an chhep ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rama thing zawng zawngin, kei Lalpa P athian hian thing sângte chu ka tihniam a, a hniamte chu ka tisâng a, Thing hring chu ka tiro va, a ro chu ka tihring a, Tih an hria ang. Kei Lalpa hian ka sawi tawh chu ka ti bawk ṭhîn.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian min hrilh leh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ ‘Paten grep thûr an ei a, an fate hâ a ṭim,’ tih upate thu hi Israel ramah engtiziaa ti chhên nge an nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Mi nung ka nih hi,’ ” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti. “Israel-te zîngah he upate thu hi an sawi leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng nunna hi ka ta a ni a, Pa nunna leh a fapa nunna pawh ka ta a ni. Ngai teh, thil sual titu chu a thi ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miin thil ṭha a tih a, dik taka ro a rel ṭhina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />bâwlhmun ruai ṭhehnaa a tel ve lohva, Israel chhûngte milem a biak ve lohva, a ṭhenawmte nupui a tihbawrhbân lohva, hmeichhe fel loh lai a khawih lohva,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tu mah tiduhdah lovin an thil pûk dahkhamte a pêk kîr zêla, tu mah a rûksak lohva, rilṭâmte chaw a pêk a, saruakte silhfên a sintîr ṭhina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a pung ûma a pûktîr lohva, thil ṭha lo laka a insûm tlat a, hleih nei lova mi chungthu a rêlsak ṭhin a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thupêkte a zawma, ka Dânte a vawn chuan chu mi chu mi dik tak a ni a, a nung ngei ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Chutiang mi chuan rûkhmang leh tual thah chîng fapa nei sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />chu a fapa chuan a pa tih ang ti ve duh lovin bâwlhmun ruai ṭhehnaah te a tela, a ṭhenawmte nupui a tihbawrhbâna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />rethei leh mangangte a tihduhdah a, mi rawk a chîna, thil pûk dahkham a pêk kîr duh lohva, milem biain thil tenawm a tih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a pung ûma a pûktîra, hêng thil tenawm hi a tih ṭhin avângin a thi mawlh ang, a nung lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Chu mi chuan fapa hring ve se, chu a fapa chuan a pa thil sual tih zawng zawng chu hmuin a rilru a siam a, a ti ve duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bâwlhmun ruai ṭhehnaah a tel duh lo va, Israel chhûngte milem chu a be ve duh lo va, a ṭhenawmte nupui a tibawrhbâng duh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu mah a tiduhdah lo va, pûk dahkham a la duh lo va, tu mah a rûksak lo va, rilṭâm hnênah chaw a pe a, saruak silhfên a sintîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />retheite lakah a kawm lo va, a pung a ûm hek lo. Dik takin thil a ti a, ka thupêk a zâwm a, chu mi chu a pa bawhchhiatna avâng chuan a thi tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pa chuan mi a tiduhdah ṭhîn a, mahni unau ngeite pawh a rawk a, a mite chungah thil ṭha lo a ti ṭhîn a; chu a pa chu a bawhchhiatna avâng chuan a thi ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />‘Engah nge fapa chuan a pa sual mawh chu a phurh loh vang?’ in ti ṭhîn a; nimahsela, fapa chuan dik taka thil a tih a, ka thupêkte a pawm vek a, a zawm chuan a nung ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil sual titu chu a thi ang; fate chuan an pa sual mawh an phur lo vang. Mi dik chuan a dik man a têl ang a, mi sual chuan a sual man a hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mi sual chu a bawhchhiatna ata a lamlêta, ka thupêk te vawnga thil dik leh ṭha a tih chuan a nung ang a, a thi lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A thil sual tihte chu hriat reng a ni lo vang a, thil ṭha a tih avâng chuan a nung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi sual an thih hi ka lâwmzâwng em ni?” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti; “An lo lamlêt a, an nun hi ka lâwmzâwng a ni zâwk lâwm ni?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mi ṭha pawhin thil ṭha hawisanin thil sual a tih a, mi sualte tih anga thil tenawm tinrêng a tih ve chuan a nung dâwn em ni? A thil ṭha tihte chu hriat reng a ni tawh lo vang a, a thil sual tih leh a bawhchhiatnate avâng chuan a thi mawlh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“ ‘ Lalpa hian mumal neiin thil a ti lo ve a’ in ti ṭhîn.Israel chhûngte u, ngaithla teh u, mumal nei lovin thil ka ti lo va, in awm dân hi a mumal lo a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi ṭhain thil ṭha tih a bânsan a, thil sual a tih chuan a thi ang, thil sual a tih avâng ngei chuan a thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi sual pawhin a thil sual tih ṭhin a sima, thil dik leh ṭha a tih chuan a nun a humhim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A rilru a siam a, a sualte a bânsan vek chuan a nung ang a, a thi hauh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel chhûngte chuan ‘ Lalpa hian mumal neiin thil a ti lo,’ an ti a. Israel chhûngte u, mumal nei lovin thil ka ti lo va, nangni awm dân hi a mumal lo a ni zâwk lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuvângin, Israel chhûngte u, mi tin an awm dân zêlin an chungah ro ka rêl ang, Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti. Lo hawi kîr ula, in thil sual tih zawng zawng ata lo lamlêt rawh u; tichuan, in tân dâltu sual a ni tawh dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />In bawhchhiatnate chu paih bo ula, thinlung thar leh rilru thar pu rawh u. Israel chhûngte u, engah nge in thih mai ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi an thi hi ka lâwmzâwng a ni nêm,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti. “Lam lêt ula, nung rawh u.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Israel miliante sûnna hla phuah la, heti hian ti ang che:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />‘I nu chu sakeibakneipui a ni a, Sakeibaknei vânglai zînga bawkin no a châwm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kawlh tak pakhat a châwm lian a, A puitlin chuan sa a seh thei hle a, Mihring pawh a seh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hnam dangte chuan an hriatin, Hum an lai a, a tla ta a; Thîr kawl an buntîr a, Aigupta ramah an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nghahfâk, a beisei ber chu A bo ta tih a hriat chuan, No dang a châwm lian leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A puitlin chuan sakeibaknei zîngah a tla ve a, Sa a seh thei ta hle a, Mihring pawh a seh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An kulhte a tichhia a, An khuate a tiram a, A rûm hlauvin chhuakvâk ngam rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hnam dangte chuan an rawn bei a, Kil tin aṭangin an lo kal, Lênin an han khuh a, An hum laihah a tla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thîr kawl an buntîr a, bâwmah an khung, Israel tlângramah te A rûm an hriat tawh loh nân Ripa khungin Babulon lal an pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I nu chu grep hrui lui kam huana hi a ni. Tui a ṭhat avângin a duah hluah hluah a, A rah duh êm êm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lal tianga hman tlâk, ṭang khauh pui pui a nei a, A kûng chu a sâng hle a, a buk luai a, An en huai huai mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thinurna avângin pawh phawn a ni a, Leiah an paih ta a, Khawchhak thliin a chhêm ro va, A rah a ṭîl zo ta. A ṭang khauh pui puite a ro zo va, A kâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tui vânna ramro thlalêrah chuan An phun sawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A zâr aṭang chuan mei a lo chhuak a, A rahte chu a kâng zo ta, Lal tiang tlâk ṭang lian a nei ta lo.’ Hei hi sûnna hla a ni a, sak fo tûr a ni.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sarih kum, thla ngana, tahrik ni sâwm ni chuan Israel upate chu Lalpa râwn tûrin an lo kal a, ka hmaah an ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian mi rawn hrilh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel upate hnênah thu sawi la, heti hian ti ang che: Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: mi râwn tûrin in lo kal a ni maw? Mi nunga chu ka nih hi, nangni râwn tûr em ka nih?” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, anniho hi i chachhuah dâwn lâwm ni? An pate thil tenawm tih chu hrilh la, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel, ka mi thlan, Jakoba thlahte chungah ka bân ka phar a, kut phar meuhvin, ‘Kei hi in Pathian, Lalpa chu ka ni,’ tiin Aigupta ramah khân ka inhriattîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Aigupta ram ata, ka ram zawn chhuah, hnutetui leh khawizu luanna ram, ram azawnga ram ṭha bera hruai lût tûr che uin thu ka tiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An hnênah, ‘In duhzâwng, thil tenawmte chu paih ula, Aigupta ram milemte chuan intibawrhbâng suh u, kei hi in Pathian, Lalpa chu ka nih hi,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mahse, ka chungah an hel a, ka thu tu man an ngaithla duh lo va, an duhzâwng thil tenawmte chu an paih duh lo va, Aigupta ram milemte lah an thlah duh hek lo; tichuan, Aigupta ramah ngei an chungah ka thinrim ka hrithla ang a, ka thinur ka leihbua ang ka ti hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mahse, an awmna hnamte hmuhah ka hming a chhiat loh nân ka ti ta êm lo va, Aigupta ram aṭangin ka hruai chhuak dâwn tih ka lo puang tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Aigupta ram aṭangin thlalêr ka hruai thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Miin an zawma an nun theihna tûr, ka thupêkte chu, ka hrilh a, ka Dân chu ka zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Anni nêna kan inkâr chhinchhiahna atân sabat ni pawh ka ruatsak a, anmahni la hrangtu ka nih an hriat theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mahse, Israel chhûngte chuan thlalêrah khân min helsan a, miin an zawma an nun theih nâna ka thupêkte chu an zâwm duh lo va, ka Dânte an hawisan a, ka sabat nite lah an bawhchhe zêl a; tichuan, thlalêrah, anmahni timang tûrin ka thinur chu an chungah ka leih nâng emaw ka ti hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mahse, ka hruai chhuah lai hmutu hnam dangte mit hmuhah ka hming a hliau loh nân ka ti ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thlalêrah chuan ka pêk tûr ram, hnutetui leh khawizu-a luang, ram azawnga ram ṭha berah chuan ka hruai lût lo vang tiin ka tiam ta hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An milemte ngaina zâwkin ka Dânte an hnâwl a, ka thupêkte an zâwm duh lo va, ka sabat nite an bawhchhe ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahse, thlalêra tihhlum êm atân chuan ka khawngaih a, ka tiboral vek ta lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thlalêrah khân an fate hnênah, ‘In pate thupêk zâwm suh u, an dânte pawisa hek suh ula, an milemte chuan intibawrhbâng hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />kei hi in Pathian, Lalpa chu ka ni, ka thupêkte zâwm ula, ka Dânte pawisain zâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka sabat nite serh ula; tichuan, kei leh nangni inkâra chhinchhiahna a ni ang a, in Pathian, Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hre ṭhîn dâwn nia’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mahse, an fate pawh chuan, min helsan a, miin an zawma an nun theihna tûr, ka thupêkte chu, an awih duh lo va, ka dânte chu an zâwm hek lo; ka sabat nite chu an bawhchhia a, thlalêrah khân ka thinrim ka hrîkthlâk nân an chungah ka thinur ka leih nâng emaw ka ti hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mahse, ka hruai chhuah lai hmutu hnam dangte hmuhah ka hming a chhiat loh nân ka insûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thlalêrah ngei khân, ‘Hnam dang zîngah ka thawn darh ang a, ram tinah ka tidarh ang,’ tiin ka tiam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka dânte an zâwm duh lo va, ka thupêkte an awih lo va, ka sabat nite bawhchhiain an pate milemte chuan an mit a la ta zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuvângin, an ṭhatna tûr ni lo dân ka siam a, an nun theih lohna tûr thu ka pe bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />an thilhlante chuan anmahni ka intihbawrhbântîr a, an fa tîrte pawh inthawi nân an hmang ta a ni; thiam loh an chana, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hriat theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Chuvângin, Mihring fapa, Israel chhûngte hnênah heti hian sawi rawh, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: In paten min phatsan avângin min tihmingchhe hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pêk ka tum ram ka hruai thlen khân tlâng sângte leh thing hringte an han hmu a; tah chuan an inthawinate an hlân ta mai a; min elsênin thilpêkte an hlân a, rimtuite an hâl a, an thil hlan uainte an bun chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />‘Hêng hmunsângahte hian engtizia nge in kal?’ ka ti a: chûng chu tûn thlengin ‘hmunsâng’ tih a la ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuvângin, Israel chhûngte hrilh rawh, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: In pate hnung zuiin in intibawlhhlawh a, an thil tenawm tih in ti zui zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Milem hnêna thil hlan leh inthawi nân in fate hâl ralin vawiin thleng hian in intibawrhbâng si a, Israel chhûngte u, min râwn tûra lo kal tûr em in nih? Mi nung ka nih hi, Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti. Nangni râwn tûr ka ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hnam dang, he rama chi hrang hrang awmte tih dân angin thing leh lung biak in tum ta tlat si a; mahse, in be hlek lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Mi nung ka nih hi,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti; “Ka hrilh lâwk a che u; in chungah dîm lo tawpin ka kut ka lek ang a, in chungah lal ka hrawt ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hnam dang zîng, in darhna ram aṭanga ka hruai kîr hunah che u ka thiltihtheihzia leh ka thinurzia ka entîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hnam dang ramah, thlalêrah chuan ka hruai ang che u a, inhmachhawnin in chungthu ka rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Aigupta ram thlalêra in pate chungthu ka rêl ang khân in chungthu ka rêl ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Talhfiak nên ka vil ang che u a, ka thuthlungah ka luhtîr tlat ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />In zînga hel leh ka chunga thil sual titute chu ka thian ang a, an awmna ram ata ka hruai chhuak ang a; mahse, Israel ram an thleng ve lo vang; tichuan, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Nangni Israel chhûngte u, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Mahni milem chu pan ṭheuh ula, chibai bûk mai teh u. Ka thu in ngaithla duh si lo! Ka hming thianghlim hi in thilhlan leh milemte chuan tibawrhbâng tawh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Israel ram, ka tlâng thianghlimah chuan, Israel chhûng tin, in zavaiin, chu ramah chuan ka rawng in bâwl ang a, tah chuan ka lo lâwm ang che u a, in thên thilhlan te, rah hmasa in hlan te, in thil thianghlim hlan te ka lo dawng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Hnam dang zîng ata ka hruai chhuah che u a, in darhna ram ata ka hruai khâwm hunah che u chuan in thil rimtui hlan nên ka lo lâwm ang che u a, hnam dangte chuan ka thianghlimzia an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Kut phar meuhva in pate hnêna pêk ka tiam ram ka thlen hunah che u kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />In khawsak dân leh in thiltih a in intihbawrhbân ṭhin te kha in hre chhuak ang a, thil sual in tih avângin nangmahni in inngei hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Aw Israel chhûngte u, ka hming avângin, in awm dân sual leh chimawm taka thil in ti ṭhin ang lova in chunga thil ka tih hunah chuan Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang,” Lalpa, P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, chhim lam hawi la, chhim lam ram demin thu sawi la, chhim lam ngaw chungthu puang rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Chhim lam ngaw chu ngaithla tûrin hrilh la: Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Ngai teh, i chungah mei ka tichhuak ang a, thing hring leh ro, a vaiin a kâng vek ang. A alh chu tu man an ṭhelh thei lo vang a, chhim leh hmârah a darh ang a, mi tin hmêl a em ût vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Kei Lalpa hian ka tihkan a ni tih tu pawhin an hria ang a, tu man an ṭhelh thei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Kei chuan, “Khai a! Lalpa P athian , ‘thu khirh hlîr a sawi ṭhîn,’ min ti dêr tawh asin,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a sawi a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Jerusalem lam hawi la, hmun thianghlim demin thu sawi la, Israel ram chungchâng thu puang rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel ram hnênah heti hian ti rawh: Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Ngai teh, i chungah ka ṭuan dâwn, ka khandaih chu a pai ata ka phawi ang a, in zînga mi ṭha pawh, mi sual pawh ka râwt vek dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi ṭha leh mi sual ka râwt dâwn avângin chhim leh hmâra mi zawng zawng chungah khandaih ka lek dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, tu pawhin kei Lalpa hian khandaih chu ka phawi a, ka khung leh dâwn lo tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Nang mihring fapa, rîl pawh thlâk ang chûlin chiau la, an hmuh ngeiah lungchhe takin ṭap rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Engati nge i chiau tak chûl?’ an tih che chuan, ‘A sawi chu a lo thlen mai dâwn avângin ka chiau a ni. Mi zawng zawng an zâm ang a, an bân tha a zâwi ang a, an thlabâr ang, an khûpte pawh a sâwi hlawk hlawk ang,’ ti ang che. Ngai teh, a lo thleng ṭêp a ni,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian mi hrilh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, hetiang hian puang rawh, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Khandaih chu tah hriam a ni a, Khandaih chu nawh tlêt a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Insah nân tah hriam a ni a, Kâwlphe anga de zawr zawr tûra nawh tlêt a ni. Hlim rual a ni nêm! Ka mite hian zilhna an pawisak hauh loh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hman theih maiin khandaih tah a ni tawh; A ni, thîr hriama nawh tlêt a ni, Thattu kenah peih a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihring fapa, ṭap la, chiau vawng vawng rawh, Ka mite tuar tûr a ni si, Ka mite chu Israel miliante nên khandaiha sah an ni dâwn. Mangangin i khêl bêng rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mite hi fiah an ni a, An sim loh chuan an boral ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Nang mihring fapa, thu puang rawh, I kutphah chûm la, Khandaih chuan vawi hnih vawi thum sât sela, Sât sât rawh se; Khandaih hrâng a ni a, Khandaih lian pui, hlauhawm tak a ni, An vêla mite thahna tûr chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka mite chu a tizâm a, an tlu zo ta, Inthahna khandaih, kâwlphe anga de zawr zawr tûr, Kulh kawngka tinah ka dah ta, Mi thah nân khêk tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khai le, ding lam leh vei lam I hawi lam apiang sâm zêl mai teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei pawhin ka kut ka lo chûm ang a, Tichuan, ka thinur a dai tawh ang. Kei Lalpa hian ka sawi tawh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian mi hrilh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Nang mihring fapa, ram pakhat aṭanga kawng lo chhuak pêng ta, khandaih nêna Babulon-ho kal zêlna tûr kâwk chu chhinchhiah rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pêng laiah chuan kutkâwk târ la, pakhat chuan Amon khua Raba kawng kâwk sela, pakhat chuan Jerusalem kulh kawng kâwk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Babulon lal chu pêngah chuan, a kalna tûr zâwk hriat nân aienin thal a thing a, milem a râwn a, an inthawina sa thin chu a en vung vung mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem hawi zâwnga tla, aienna thal chu a kut ding lamin a chhar a, kulh bang chhut chhiatna va bun tûr te, lei chhûng pâwnga hual bang siam tûrte niin a ngai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Jerusalem mite chuan Babulon nêna thu an lo thlun tawh avângin aienna dik lovah an ngai a; mahse, an sualzia hriat chhuahtîr tûr a ni a, man an ni ngei dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: In bawhchhiatna chu hriat reng a ni a, in sualte chu puanzâr a ni a, in thiltih apiangah in bawlhhlawhzia a lan hi: hrem in ni dâwn, hmêlmain an man dâwn a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Nang, Israel-te hotu, mi sual, thah tûr i ni. I thih ni chu a lo thleng ta, bawhchhe tûr i awm tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: I lallukhum leh i diar chu phawng rawh, a ngaiin thil a awm dâwn lo; mi tlâwmte chu chawisân an ni ang a, mi liante chu tihtlâwm an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A chhe dâwn, a chhe dâwn, ka tichhe dâwn; mahse, a neitu dik tak tûr a lo kal hma chu ka ti lo vang, a hnênah ka pe dâwn a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Nang Mihring fapa, thu puang la, mi dem hrât Amon mite hnênah chuan heti hian ti rawh: Insah hlum nân khandaih chu an phawi ta, Khandaih hriam nawh tlêt, Kâwlphe anga de zawr zawr tûr chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Dâwt ni si inlârna an hmu a, aienna dik lovin ai an ensak che a ni, i nghâwngah khandaih a bûr dâwn, i sualna tenawm avângin i hun a thleng ta, hrem i nih hun chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khandaih chu a paiah khung mai rawh, i pian i mûrna ramah i chungthu ka rêl dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka thinurna chu i chungah ka leih ang a, ka thinrimna mei chu i chungah ka chhêm alh ang. Mi that ṭhang pa nunrâwng pui pui kutah ka hlân ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mei chuan a kâng ang chia, nangma ram ngeiah i thisen a chhuak ang; tu man an hre reng lo vang che, kei Lalpa P athian hian ka sawi tawh hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nang, Mihring fapa, tualthahna khawpui chachhuah tûrin i inpeih em? An thil tenawm tih zawng zawng chu hrilh vek ta che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti ti rawh: Tual thah chîng leh milema intibawlhhlawh khawpui tâwpna chu a lo thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thisen in chhuahte avângin ka thiam lo che u a ni; in milem siamte chuan in intibawrhbâng a, in tâwpna hun chu in tihnai a, a lo thleng ṭêp a ni. Hnam tin hmuhsit leh ram tina nuihzatbûrah ka siam ta che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Innghirngho chîng, khaw hmingchhe tak i nih avângin i bul hnaia awmte leh ram hla taka awmte pawhin an nuihzat che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ngai teh, khuaa Israel hotute chu an theih ang anga, tualthah inpeih rengin an khawsa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu mahin nu leh pa an zah lo va, hnam dang mite an hnehchhiah a, fahrah leh hmeithaite dik lo takin an sawisa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka Hmun Thianghlim an zah lo va, ka sabat ni an bawhchhia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tihhlum tûrin mi dang an hêk a, bâwlhmuna inthawina ruai an kîl a, khuaah chuan an hur kual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat chuan an pate nupui an mutpui a, hmeichhe fel lo lai an pâwl lui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ṭhenkhatin mahni ṭhenawm nupui an tibawrhbâng a, an mote pawh an khawih a, an pate fanu, an farnu ngeite pawh an tibawlhhlawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tual that tûra thamna late an awm a, a pung an ûm a, ṭhenawm khawvêngte hrêkin an hlêp ṭeuh ṭeuh va, kei ngei pawh min theihnghilh ta,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ngai teh, in zîngah mawi leh mawi lo thlu lêk lova hlêp leh tual thah in chîn avângin ka kut ka ben khum dâwn a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In chunga ka ṭuan hunah in tuar ngamin in lo ṭang zo dâwn em ni? Kei Lalpa hian ka sawi hi, ka ti ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hnam dang zîngah ka tidarh ang che u a, chutiang chuan in bawlhhlawhna chu ka tibo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hnam dangte chuan an lungten ang che u a; tichuan, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian mi hrilh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel chhûngte hi an zavaiin a êkchhia vek an ni, rawhtuina meia tangka rawh fai hnua a êkchhia, dâr te, ṭin te, suan te ang lek hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: A êkchhia ang lek in nih tâk avângin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jerusalem khaw chhûngah ka khung khâwm ang che u; tangkarua te, dâr te, suan te rawhtuina bêla an dah khâwma an rawh tui ang hian ka thinura ka lungnih loh êm êm avângin ka dah khâwm ang che u a, ka rawhtui ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ni, ka dah khâwm ang che u a, ka thinurna mei chu ka chhêm hnan ang che u a, Jerusalem khaw chhûngah chuan ka rawh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tangkarua, rawhtuina bêla an rawhtui ang hian in tui zo vang; tichuan, kei Lalpa hian ka thinur in chungah ka leih a ni tih in hria ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian mi hrilh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel-te hi hrilh rawh. An ram chu ram then fai loh a ni a, thinurna ni avânga ruah dawng lo ram a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An hotute chu sakeibaknei sa hauh rûm ang an ni; mi an that a, mi sum leh thil hlute an lâksak a, mi tam tak an tihmeithai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Puithiamte chuan ka dân an hmusit a, ka thil thianghlimte an tibawrhbâng a, thianghlim leh thianghlim lo an thliar thei lo va, a thiang leh thiang lo mi an zirtîr thei hek lo. Ka sabat ni an hai der a, an zînga tu mahin min zah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An hotute chu chinghne koham, a hmuh apiang seh zêl ang hi an ni: hlâwkna tûr a awm phawt chuan mi thah an tîm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zâwlneite chuan inlârna an hmu der a, dâwt thu hril lâwkin chinai an hnawih mawi bang ang hian an thiltihte chu an sawi mawisak a; ka sawi loh pui, ‘Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thingtlânga awmte pawhin mi dang an nêkchêp a, rawk an chîng a, retheite leh pachhiate an tiduhdah a, ram dang mite dik lo takin an hnehchhiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thinura ram chu ka tihchhiat vek loh nân a bang chim rem ṭha tûr, a chhe laia lo ṭang tûr mi, an zîngah ka zawng a, ka hmu zo hauh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka thinurna an chungah ka leih ang a, ka thinrimna mei chuan a tihlum ang; an thiltih mawh chu an chungah ka nghat dâwn a ni,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a sawi a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, nu pakhatin fanu pahnih a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An tleirâwl chhuah aṭangin Aigupta ramah mi hurah an ṭang a, an hnute te an dehsak a, an nulâtna an hloh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A upa zâwk hming chu Oholai a ni a, Samari entîrna a ni; a naupang zâwk chu Oholabai a ni a, Jerusalem entîrna a ni. Nupuiah ka nei a, fanu fapa min hrinsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka nupui ni chungin Oholai chuan min hursan a, a ngaihzâwng, râlhrâtho, Asuria chu a hak hiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng chu kawr sena inthuam, milian leh hotu lal, tlangvâl hmêlṭha thlan, sakawr chungchuang mi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chûng Asuria mi chhuante nula chu a ni ta a; an milemte ngaisângin a be ve a, a intibawrhbâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta rama a hurna kha a la sim lo va ni, a tleirâwl chhuah aṭang rêngin mipain an mutpui ṭhîn a, an nula angin an chei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, a ngaihzâwng, a hak hiam ṭhin Asuria mite kutah ka pe ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anni chuan a silhfên an hlihsak vek a, a fanu fapate chu an kawisak a, amah chu khandaihin an that a; a thil tuar chu hmeichheho sawiṭhaihna ber a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“A nau Oholibai chuan chûng chu a hmuh pawhin a u ai chuan mi dang a hak hiam dân leh a hur dân chu a nasa zâwk ta daih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asuria milian leh hotu lal, râlhrât, kawr senlâr ha, sakawr chungchuang, tlangvâl rual hmêlṭha thlante chu a hak ve ta hiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani pawh chu a intibawrhbâng ta tih ka hmu a, a u siar a u siar a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hurna chu a zual tulh tulh a; Kaldai hotu lian thlâ, banga an ziak, senlâr vûta rawng an hnawih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />kâwnghrên mawi tak hrênga, diar fêm buk tak khim, han en pawha hotu ni âwm hliah hliah, Babulon mi, Kaldai rama piangte lem chu a han hmu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a ngaizâwng ta a, Kaldai mite hnênah chuan puarak te a tîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Babulon mite chu an lo kal a, an rawn mutpui a, an tibawrhbâng ta a. Duh tâwka an chêt hnu chuan a ngei ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutia a lang a pauva a hur a, inhlîm a hreh loh avâng chuan a u ang bawkin ka ngei ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aigupta rama a tleirâwl hurna kha a la reh lo, a hur tulh tulh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sabengtung leh sakawr anga lian mi hur pui pui mutpui tûr a melh riai mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aigupta rama i hnute an dehsak che a, i nulâtna i hloh tâk china i tleirâwl hurna chu i la chhunzawm zêl a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Chuvângin, Oholiba, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Ngai teh, i ngaihzâwngte chu i chungah ka ṭuantîr dâwn. I ngaihzâwng, i ngei tâkte kha, kil tin aṭangin ka rawn hualtîr dâwn a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Babulon mi te, Kaldai mi te, Pekod mi te, Shoa leh Koa mite leh Asuria-ho te chu ka rawn hruai ang. Babulon mi, Kaldai tlangvâl hmêlṭha thlan ṭhiau, milian leh hotu lal, râlhrât rual leh sakawr chungchuang hotute chu ka rawn khâwm dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hmâr lam aṭangin an lo kal ang a, sipai tam tak, sakawrtawlailîr hmang leh thil phur tawlailîr nên, phaw keng leh awmphaw ha-in, invenna lukhum nên an rawn hual ang che a, an duh duha an tih tûrin an kutah ka dah tawh che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I chungah ka thinur a, anni pawh thinur taka sawisa tûr chein ka ti a ni; i hnâr te, i beng te an hlep ang a, in zînga la dam chu khandaihin an that ang. I fanu fapate chu an man ang a, an man bâng chu an kâng hlum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I thawmhnawte an hlihsak vek ang chia, i ṭhi mawite chu an lâksak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />I hurna leh i nawhchi zawrh, Aigupta ram aṭanga i chhawm chu, ka titâwp ang. Aigupta chu thlîr kîrin i ngaihtuah tawh lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, i huatzâwng leh i mi ngeite kutah ka hlân dâwn che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An huat êm che avângin an sawisa nek ang che; i thawh chhuah zawng zawng an lâksak ang che a, saruakin, a lâwng maiin an lum reng ang che. I hur avâng leh nawhchi i zawrh avângin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />hêng hi i chungah i tithleng a ni, hnam dang dang ûmin i hur bo va, an milemte chuan i intibawrhbâng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />i u awm dâna i awm ve zêl avângin i tuar tûr no chu ka pe a che.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “No lian pui, dawng hlâwk tak, i u no chu in rawh, Mi tinin an hmusit ang chia, An nuihzat ang che. A dawng hlâwk êm a nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />I rui ang a, i mangang hle ang, Hlauhna leh chhiatnaa khat no a ni. I u Samaria no chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />I in ang a, i tlâk vek tûr a ni, A keh them lam in tel la, I hnute te chu pawt fân rawh.” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan, “Kei hi a siamtu che ka ni,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Min theihnghilh a, min hawisan tâk avângin i hurna leh i nawhchi zawrh mawh chu i phur ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a sawi a: “Mihring fapa, Oholai leh Oholabai te hi chachhuah tûrin i inpeih em? An tenawmzia hrilh teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An uire a, an kutah thisen a kai hnuang mai; milem biain an uire a, fapa min hrinsakte chu an that a, milem hnênah an hlân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka chungah hei chauh hi an ti nêm! Ka Hmun Thianghlim an tibawrhbâng a, ka sabat ni an bawhchhe bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />An fate, milem hmaa an thah ni la lain, chumi ni ngei chuan, ka Hmun Thianghlimah an lo kal a, ka in chu an rawn tibawrhbâng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ram hla taka mi sâwm tûrin puarakte an tîr chhên a, chûng mite chu an lo kal a. Anni chu an lo inbual fai a, an mit an hnawih dûr a, ṭhi man tamte an lo awrh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Khum nuam takah an ṭhu a, ei tûr tui tui dah khâwmna dawhkân an chhawp a, ka pêk thil rimtui leh hriakte chu an dah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Engthâwl taka nuam chênin an ri bûng bûng a; thlalêr aṭanga sâwm khâwm ṭeuh te chuan ngûn an buntîr a, lukhim mawi tak an khimtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Uire chau tawh chu nawhchizuar angin an chei a nih hi,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Nawhchizuar, miin an pan ṭhin angin mi hur Oholai leh Oholabai chu an la pan ta chhên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Uire leh tualthatah mi dikte chuan an puh ang a, thiam loh an chantîr ngei ang; uire an chîng a, an kutah thisen a kai hnuang si a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Tihthlabâr tûr leh rawk tûrin mipui khâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mipui chuan lungin dêng sela, khandaihin tan sela, an fanu fapate chu that rawh se, an inte pawh hâl rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ram pumah an hurna chu ka tibo dâwn, hmeichhe dangte pawhin anni anga hur an chîn ve loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Nangni unau hian in hur man in tuar ang a, milema in in-tihbawrhbân mawh chu in phur ang. Tichuan, kei hi Lalpa P athian chu ka nih in hria ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum kuana thla sâwm, ni sâwm ni chuan Lalpan heti hian mi hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, ziakna la la, vawiin tahrik ni hi ziak teh, vawiin hi Babulon lalin Jerusalem a hual ṭan ni a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hel hmang chhûng tân he tehkhin thu hi sawi rawh; ‘Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti,’ ti rawh: Chhuang rú, bêl chu chhuang rú, Tui pawh leih khat rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sa ti ṭha ṭha, a bawp leh dâr, A irno ruhte nên la khâwm ula, Tikhat rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Berâm tuihnai hnai talh ula, Thukah thing rawlh ṭeuh ṭeuh rawh u. So bawrh bawrh sela, A ruh filhin hmin teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Tualthahna khawpui chu a chung a pik e. Tihfai ngai loh khirkhâwng hlîr a ni. Sa hrang chu thlang chuang lovin thur vek rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khaw chhûngah mi an that a, an thisen chu lungpui châr chungah a luang, leiah luang se vaivutin a chhilh tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chhilh a nih loh nân lungpui châr chungah ka luantîr a ni: mi tihthinrima phuba ka lâk theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tichuan, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Tualthahna khawpui, i chung a pik e! Kei ngei hian thingfâk chu ka rawlh ṭeuh dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thing fawm belh ula, chhêm hluah hluah rawh u; sa chu hmin kawi sela, chhuang kang rêt ula, a ruhte chu rawh ral rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dâr bêl ruak chu meiling chungah chhuang reng ula, ling vur rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A khirkhâwng bawlhhlawh chu a kan ral hnuah bêl chu a thianghlim leh ang. A khirkhâwng chuti zozai chu hah hnêp khawpin tihfai tum mah la, i tifai thei lo vang, mei chauhvin a tifai thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In hurna chuan a tibawlhhlawh che u a, tihfai ka tum che u a, in fai thei si lo; ka thinur mei in tuar hma chu in fai dâwn lo va nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei Lalpa hian ka sawi tawh a, ka hun a lo thleng ang a, ka ti ngei ang. Ka ngaizam mai lo vang, ka lainat lo vang a, pawi ka ti hek lo vang. In awm dân leh in thil tih dân ang chiahin in chungah ro ka rêl ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian mi hrilh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, i duh lai tak ka tina thut ang a, ka lâksak dâwn a che. I ṭap ri tûr a ni lo va, i mittui a tla tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngawi rengin inhnîp la, lusûn angin awm suh, diar khim la, pheikhawk bun rawh, i hmai tuam suh la, lusûn ei ang ei hek suh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi tûk chuan mipui hnênah thu ka sawi a, tlaiah chuan ka nupui chu a thi ta mai a. Thu min pêk ang khân a tûk zîngah chuan ka ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mite chuan, “Engtizia nge hetia i tih, min hrilh teh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anni chu ka bia a; Lalpa thu ka hnênah hetiang hian a lo thleng a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Israel chhûngte hnênah sawi rawh. Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Ngai teh u, ka Hmun Thianghlim, rinawm in tih êm êm, in chhuan, hmuh in kham theih loh, in lainat êm êm chu ka tibawrhbâng dâwn a ni. In fanu fapa Jerusalem-a la awmte chu khandaihin an sât hlum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka tih ang hian in ti ve dâwn a ni: in hmui in khuh lo vang a, lusûn ei ang in ei hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Diar in khim tûr a ni, pheikhawk in bun ang a, in ṭap ri tûr a ni lo. In bawhchhiatna avângin in chau vang a, in inrûm chhâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ezekiela hi in tân chhinchhiahna a ni ang, a tih ang zêl hian in ti dâwn a ni; chumi hnuah chuan kei hi Lalpa P athian chu ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Nang, Mihring fapa, an hlimpui leh an chhuan, hmun rinawm tak, hmuh an kham theih loh, an lainat êm êm chu ka chhuhsak ang a, an fanu fapate chu ka la bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A tlân chhuak awm chhun chu i hnênah a lo kal ang a, i beng ngeiin a thu i ngaithla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan i ṭawng thei leh tawh ang a, lo tlân chhuak chhun chu i be thei ang. Tichuan, an tân chhinchhiahna i ni ang a, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian mi hrilh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Amon ram lam hawi la, thû puan khum rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amon mite hnênah, ‘Lalpa P athian thu hi ngaithla rawh u,’ ti rawh. Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Ka Hmun Thianghlim an tihbawrhbâna, Israel ram an tihchhiata, Judai ram mite sala an hruai khân i lâwm vei hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuvângin, ngai teh, khawchhak mite kutah ka pe ang che u. In ramah bûk an rawn tlar ang a, hmun an khuar ang. In thei rahte leh in ran hnutetuite chu an tlân ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Raba khawpui chu sanghâwngsei tlatna hmunah ka siam ang a, Amon ram pum chu ran tlatna hmun a ni ang; tichuan, Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Israel ram chu a chhiat avângin hmusit êm êmin hlim takin kut i bêng a, i ke i per vei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />chuvângin, ngai teh, i chungah ka kut ka lek dâwn a ni. Hnam dang kutah ka pe ang chia, an rallâk sum i ni ang. Hnama chhiar tlâk lohvah ka siam ang che a, ka tichhe vek ang chia, ram nei lovin ka siam ang che. Tichuan, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih i hria ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Moab leh Seir chuan Judai ram pawh ram dang ang bawk a lo nih lek hi,’ an ti vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, ngai teh, Moab ramri humtu khawpuite chu ka tudarh dâwn, ram mawi taka khawpui Beth-jesimot te, Baal-meon te, Kiriathaim khua te chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khawchhak mite chu Amon chungah nên an che ang a, an neih atân an ram chu ka pe ang. Amon mite chu hnama chhiar an ni tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moab chungthu chu ka rêl ang a; tichuan, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Edom chuan Judai ram chungah phuba a la nghek a, hetia phuba an la mai hi an thiam lo tak zet a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Edom chungah ka kut ka lek dâwn; mihring pawh, ran pawh ka tihlum ang. Teman khua aṭanga Dedan khaw thlengin ka tichhia ang a, khandaihin mite chu ka sât hlum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Edom chunga ka phuba chu la tûrin ka mi Israel-te chu thu ka pe ta; ka lungnihlohzia leh ka thinurzia an tilang ang. Phuba ka la a ni tih an hria ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Filistia-ho chuan an kumkhaw hmêlma chungah râwng takin phuba an la a, hmusit takin an tichhe vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Filistia chungah ka kut ka lek dâwn; Keret mite chu ka tihlum ang a, tuipui kama la awmte pawh chu ka tihlum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thinur takin an chungah phuba ka la ang a; tichuan, kei Lalpa hian an chungah phuba ka la a ni tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sâwm leh pakhatna, thla ni hmasa berah chuan Lalpan heti hian a sawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Tura mite chuan Jerusalem chungchângah hlim takin, ‘Chei! Hnam tin kawtchhuah, Jerusalem chu a chhe ta vek mai! A chhiat tâk avângin keini kan changtlung hlauh vang,’ an ti vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Aw Tura, ngai teh, i chungah ka ṭuan dâwn, tuifinriat fâwn angin hnam tam tak rawn bei tûr chein ka rawn tîr dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tura kulh bang chu an tichhia ang a, an insângte an tichim ang, a chung lei chu ka phiat fai hliau vang a, lung pialtlêp ngawt a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuifinriata lên dêngho lên phona a ni ang. Kei hian ka sawi tawh hi,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti: “Hnam dang tân râllâk sum an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An mi, lova awmte chu, khandaiha sah hlum an ni ang; tichuan, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, Babulon lal, Nebukadnezara, lal ropui ber chu Tura bei tûrin hmâr lam aṭangin sakawr te, tawlailîr te, sakawr chungchuang mi te, sipai te, ṭhuihruai tam tak nên ka rawn hruai dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I mi, lova awmte chu khandaihin a that ang a, khua chu hual bang a siam hnan ang a, lei a chhûng pâwng ang a, phaw nên a hual ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bang chhut chhiatna a hmang ang a, i in sângte chu hreiin a chêk chhia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An sakawr pal khûk vaivutin a bawh tlat ang che. Sakawr te, tawlailîr te leh sakawr chungchuang mi te thâwmah chuan kulh bangte chu a nghîng dawt dawt ang a, bang chim laiah an lût tup tup ang hian i kulh kawngkaah an lût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I kawtthlêr chu sakawrin a chîl phut dup ang a, mite chu khandaihin an sât hlum ang; in lungphun nghet tak takte chu an titlu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I rote leh in dâwr sum te chu duh duhin an la ang a, in kulh bang chu an tichim vek ang. In nuam, in chhuan êm êmte chu an tichim bawk ang a, lung te, thing te, thil chim hnawk te chu tuifinriatah an paih ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In zai dur dur ṭhîn chu ka titâwp ang a, in ṭingṭang ri pawh a dai dak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lung pialtlêpah ka siam ang chia, lên phona mai i ni ang; an din leh tawh lo vang che. Kei Lalpa hian ka sawi tawh hi,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tura hnênah Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “I chhiat hunah, mi an thah chiam, hliam tuarte thâwm avângin tuipui kama awmte chu hlauvin an khûr ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuifinriat kama lalte chu an lalṭhutthlêng ata an chhuak ang a, an puante chu an dah ang a, an thawmhnaw mawi tak takte chu an hlîp ang a, an khûr zawih zawih ang. Leiah an ṭhu ang a, i chhiatna chuan a râp êm avângin an khûr tâwp thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />He hla hian an ṭah ang che: ‘Tuifinriata lêngte chênna khua Khaw hmingthang chu i va han chhe hneh êm! I chhûnga chêngte chu tuifinriata lal an ni a, Khawvêla mite hlauh i nih ṭhin vei nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I chhiat ni chuan thliarkârte an khûr a, I bo ni chuan tuipuia thliarkârte an va hrilhhai em!’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Tu ma awm lohna, khaw ram angin ka tiram ang che, tuithûkpuiah ka tipil ang chia, tuifinriat chuan a chîm pil daih ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hmânlai mite chhukna khurah ka thlâk ang chia, lei hnuai pûk, kumkhaw chhiatnaah, mitthite chhukna khuaah chuan ka awmtîr ve ang che. Tichuan, tu mah an lo awm thei tawh lo vang a, mi nung ramah i awm ve dâwn tawh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I boral ang a, boral ve hi mi tinin an hlau vang. Zawng zawng che mah se, an hmu lo vang che,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian mi hrilh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nang, Mihring fapa, Tura sûnna hla phuah rawh. Tuifinriat kawtchhuaha awm, tuipui kama awm zawng zawng nêna sumdâwng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tura khaw hnênah chuan heti hian ti rawh. Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Aw Tura, ka mawi ber e, i inti a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuipui bula awm i ni a, A dintute chuan an rem mawi kher mai che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hermon tlâng fâr thing an zai a, I lawng ngulah Lebanon sidar an hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lawng kar nân Basan sasua, Chhuatah Kitim tufâr thingphel, Saingho phûm chu an hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aigupta puan ṭial mawi chu Lawng thli puan zârah i hmang a, Puanzâr dang a ngai lo ve, Elim thliarkâr puan dum leh sen, Chung zârah i hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sidon leh Arvad mite chu Lawng kartuah i chhawr a, Aw Tura, nangma mi thiamte ngei I lawng khalhtu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gebal themthiam mite chu Lawng pawp thawmtu an ni. Tuifinriata kal lawng zawng zawng chu I tân sumdâwngtu vek an ni.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Persia mi te, Lud mi te leh Put mite chu i sipaiah an ṭang a, phaw leh dâr lukhum an târ tuar a, an tiropui ngei che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Arvad leh Melek mite chuan i kulh an vên hual a, Gamad mite chuan i kulh bangah râl an vêng a, an phaw leh dâr lukhum chu bangah an târ tuar a, an tiropui ngei mai che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tarsis nên in indâwr a, tangkarua te, thîr te, ṭîn te, suan tein i bungrua an rawn lei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Javan te, Tubal te leh Mesek te nên in indâwr a, sal leh dâr bêltein i dâwr sum an rawn lei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I bungrua chuan Beth-togarma aṭangin sakawr chhawr chi te, sakawr chungchuanna chi te leh sabengtung te i chaw a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dedan nên in indâwr a, tuipui kama awm thliah thluahte chuan saingho hrawl pui pui leh thing ril dum mi an rawn lâk che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Edom mite chuan i dâwr sum leh i thil siamte an rawn lei a, i dâwr sum lei nân lungmantam te, puan senduk te, puan cheimawi te, puan zai sîn te, tuikep te, rubi lung te an rawn keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judai leh Israel ram aṭangin Minnit huit te, theipui te, khawizu te, oliv hriak te thinghnai damdawi tein an rawn dâwr che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Damaska mite chuan i dâwr sum leh i thil siamte chu an rawn la zung zung a, Helbon uain leh Sahar sahmulin an rawn dâwr che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Uzal vêla Vedan leh Javan mite chuan an rawn dâwr che a, thîr hlûm te, mosola te, thakthîng te, thing rimtui te an rawn keng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dedan mite chuan sakawr thawmhnawin i dâwr sum an rawn lei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Arab mite leh Kedar lalte chuan berâmno te, a chal te, kêlpatein i dâwr sum an rawn lei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Seba leh Rama sumdâwngtute chuan mosola ṭha ber chi leh lungmawi tinrêng leh rangkachakin i dâwr sum an rawn lei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Haran te, Kana te leh Eden khaw mite chu, Seba sumdâwngtute leh Asur leh Kilmad khaw mite nên dâwrtu che an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Puan ropui te, intuam puan te, puan senduk te, puan cheimawi te, chhuat phah ṭial buai te, la phiar mawi tak tak tein an rawn dâwr che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tarsis lawng rualte chuan i dâwr bungrua an phur thûr thûr mai - Tuifinriat lawng ang i ni, bungraw tam tak phur khat thûr chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Lawng kartuten tuifinriat zau laiah, An kar chhuak che. Khawchhak thliin a lên chhe ta che a, Khawmual hlat takah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />I hausakna, dâwr sum leh bungrua te, I lawngpu zawng zawng te, Lawng khalhtu leh lawng pût thawm thiam te, Dâwr sum hralhtu leh vêngtu sipai te, Lawnga chuang zawng zawng te chu I chhiatpui a, tuiah an tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lawng khalhtute mangang au chuan Vaukam a khâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lawng kartute an chhuak vek a, Lawngpute leh a khalhtu zawng zawng nên, Vaukamah chuan an ding ta a, Nangmah avângin an chiau vawng vawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Vaivut an inphul a, leiah an tâl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An chhîp an ziat kawlh a, saiip an fêng, Lungchhe takin an ṭah che a, Lungngai takin an rûm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />I tân ṭah hla an chham ang a, ‘Tura ang hi tu nge awm ang? Tui hnuaia pil ta vang vang hi!’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />I sumdâwngte chuan tuifinriatah I sum, dâwr bungruate an tawlh chhuak ṭeuh ṭeuh va, Hnam tin an tilungawi hle ṭhîn. I sum avângin lalte an hausa bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuifinriatah i keh ta a, A thûk laiah i pil ta a, I bungrua leh i mi chhawr te, Tuifinriatah i pilpui ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuipui kama chêng zawng zawng te, Nangmah vângin an hrilhhai hle, An lalte pawh an hmulthi a ding a, Zâm hmêl an pu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ram tina sumdâwngte pawh an chek tlawk tlawk mai, Mi tin ṭihkhaiah i lo chang ta, I boral hlen dâwn si a.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a sawi leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Tura lal hnênah heti hian ti rawh: Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “I chapo va, ‘P athian ka ni, tuifinriatah P athian lalṭhutthlêngah ka ṭhut hi,’ i ti vei a, Pathianah inngai mah la, mihring mai i nih hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Daniela aia fing zâwk, a lakah thuhrûk eng mah awm thei lo niin i inngai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sumdâwn i thiam hle a, i fin avângin i hausa a, rangkachak leh tangka i khâwl ṭeuh mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I sumdâwnna a hmuingîl a, i hausak tâk êm avângin i rilru a lo chapo ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Pathian anga fing i inti vei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh, i hmêlhriat loh, hnam azawnga hnam hlauhawm ber, nangmah bei tûr, ka rawn hruai dâwn: an khandaih chu an lek ang a, i fin avânga i mawina leh i ropuina chu an rawn tichhe vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lei vâwtah an chhuktîr ang chia, tuitla thihin i thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangmah thattu tûr hnênah, ‘Pathian ka ni,’ i ti thei dâwn em ni? Thattu tûr che kutah chuan mihring mai i ni si a, Pathian awzâwng i ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Serh tan loh thihin, Pathian hre loho kutah i thi ang. Ka ṭawng tawh hi,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mi hrilh leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Tura lal sûnna tûr hla phuah rawh: Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Finnaa khat leh mawi chungchuang, Khaw ṭha famkim chu i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian huan Eden-ah i chêng a, Lungmantam chi tinrêng i inbel a, Lunghlu te, topaz te, berul te, karnelian te, jasper te, safir te, emeral te leh garnet te chuan. Themthiam kutchhuak, rangkachaka phûm I pian ni aṭang khân i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vêng tûr chein cherub thlan ka dah a, P athian tlâng thianghlimah i awm, Lunghlu tle zîngah i lêng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thil sual i tih hma kha chuan Sawisêlbo i ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I sumdâwnna a lo zau va, Sum hrâwm i tina a, thil sual i ti ta a, Pathian tlâng lunghlu tle zînga i lênna aṭangin, Vêngtu cherub ka ûm chhuahtîr ta che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I ropuina chuan a tichapo che a, I mawina chapopuiin i finna i tichhe zo ta, Lalte ennawmah leiah ka paih thal ta dêr che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I suahsualna zozai leh Dik lo taka sum hrâwm i chîn avângin I hmun thianghlim i tibawlhhlawh a, In zîngah mei ka chhuahtîr ang a, A kâng ral ang chia, Thlîrtu hmuhah lei vaivutah ka chantîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I hmêlhriat zawng zawngte chu Nangmah vângin an thlabâr ang, Mi tân ṭihkhai i lo chang ta, I bo hlen dâwn ta si a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Sidon lam hawi la, thu sawi khum rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Aw Sidon, i chungah ka ṭuan dâwn. In zîngah chawimawi ka ni ang a, In chungthu ka rêl ang a, Ka thianghlimzia ka tilang ang. Tichuan, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hripui ka rawn lêntîr ang a, Kawtthlêrah thisen a luang ang, Kil tinah khandaihin an bei ang chia, I mite chu an tihlum ang.’ Tichuan, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Israel-te tân, an vêla awm, anmahni hmusittute chu, hnimhlîngnei leh hlîng anga chhun ṭhîntu an ni tawh lo vang a, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka thawn darhna mite zîng ata Israel chhûngte chu ka hruai khâwm hunah ka thianghlimzia hnam tin zîngah a lang ang a, ka chhiahhlawh Jakoba hnêna ram ka pêkah chuan an awm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thlamuang takin an luah ang a, in te sa-in grep huan te an siam ang. An vêla awm, anmahni hmusittute chu ka hrem hunah him takin an awm ang. Tichuan, kei Lalpa hi an Pathian chu ka ni tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sâwmna, thla sâwm, tahrik ni sâwm leh pahnihah Lalpa chuan ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Aigupta lal Farawa lam hawi la, amah leh Aigupta ram pum chu thu sawi khum rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Ngai teh, Aigupta lal, Awle lian, Nail luia chêng Faraw, i chungah ka ṭuan dâwn. ‘Nail lui hi ka ta a ni a, ka tân ka siam a ni,’ i ti vei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I khabe-ah nghakuai ka riah ang a, i phuhlipah lui sanghate chu ka behtîr ang; Nail lui aṭang chuan lui sangha, i phuhlipa bet zawng zawng nên ka hnûk chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thlalêrah ka paih ang chia, nang leh Nail luia sanghate chu leichârah in thal reng ang. Tu man in ruang an hlâwm lo vang a, chunglêng sava leh ramsa tlanah ka pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Aigupta mi zawng zawngin kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang. Israel chhûngte tân luang tiang ang lek an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An han hawl dâwn a, a tliak a; an dâr an herh phah a; an han rinchhan dâwn a, a bung ta a, an kâwng an herh ta a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, i chungah khandaih ka lek ang a, mihring leh ran ka that vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aigupta ram chu a chhiain a ram vek ang; ‘lui chu ka ta a ni a, ka tâna ka siam a ni,’ a tih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aigupta ram leh Nail lui chungah ka ṭuan dâwn a ni: Migdol aṭanga Suene, Ethiopia ram ri thlengin ka tichhe vek ang a, a ruak hlauh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kum sawmli chhûng chu ramsa pawh, mihring pawh an kal lo vang a, awm an awm hauh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kum sawmli chhûng chu ram azawnga ram chhe ber leh khua azawnga khaw chhe nasa berah ka siam ang a, Aigupta mite chu hnam dang zîngah ka hnawt darh ang a, ram tinah an darh ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Kum sawmli a ral hnu chuan an darhna ram mite zîng ata Aigupta mite chu ka hruai khâwm leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sala an tâng chu ka hruai kîr ang a, an pianna ram Pathros-ah an kîr ang a, hnam nêm tak an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hnam dang zawng zawng aiin an nêp ang a, hnam dang chungah an inlek tawh lo vang a, hnam dang chungah thu an nei tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel chhûngte chuan rinchhanah an hmang tawh lo vang a, ṭanpui atân an sâwm kha an tihdik lohzia an hre chhuak ang a, kei hi Lalpa P athian chu ka ni tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum sawmhnih leh pasarihna thla hmasa ber, tahrik ni khatah Lalpa chuan ka hnênah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Babulon lal Nebukadnezara chuan Tura bei tûrin sipai a ruai chiam a, an phur a rih êm avângin an chhîp a kawlh râwt a, an koki a pilh phung mai; mahse, Tura aṭang chuan Lal leh sipaite chuan an hah man eng mah an hmu lo.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, Babulon lal Nebukadnezara hnênah Aigupta ram ka pe dâwn. Aigupta ram thil neih tam êm êm chu a rawk ang a, a suam ang a, a sipaite hlawh atân a lâksak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka rawng an bâwl avângin Aigupta ram hi ka pe a ni,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Chutih hunah chuan Israel chhûngte chu ka tichak ang a, nang hi an zîngah thu ka sawitîr ang che; tichuan, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, thu puang la, heti hian ti rawh: Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Ṭap ula, chiau vawng vawng rawh u, Ni chu a lo thleng dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni a lo hnai ta, Lalpa ni a lo hnai e, Hnam tin tâna chhûm zîn ni chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta ramah indona a chhuak ang a, Kus ramah lungngaih manganna, Aigupta mi tam tak an thi ang a, An hausakna lâk bo a ni ang a, An innghahna tihchhiat vek a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kus mi te, Put mi te, Lud mi te, Arab-ho te, Kub te leh an thurualpuite chu indonaah an thi ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Aigupta ram tungdingtute chu an thi ang a, An chhuan, kulh rinawmte pawh, a tlâwm ang. Migdol aṭanga Suene thlengin Indonaah mi an thi ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Aigupta chu ram chhe hneh ber a ni ang a, a khuate chu khaw ram zînga chhe nasa ber a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta rama mei ka tihchhuaha, ṭanpuitute ka tihboral hunah Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aigupta chhiat ni a lo thlen chuan Ethiopia, ngaihngam taka awm tizâm tûrin lawngin lamkal ka tîr ang a, Aigupta angin an thla a bâr ang. Chumi ni chu a lo thleng ṭêp a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Lal Nebukadnezara kut hmangin Aigupta hausakna ka titâwp dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amah leh a hote, hnam râwng pui pui chu, ram tiṭiau tûrin an lo kal ang a, Aigupta mite chungah khandaih an phawi ang a, ram pumah ruang a thal pheng phung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nail lui chu ka tikang ang a, mi sual pui pui kutah ka pe ang. Hnam dang mite chuan ram chu, a chhûnga awmte nên an tichhe vek ang. Kei Lalpa hian ka sawi tawh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Nof khaw milemte chu ka tichhia ang a, thil tlâktlailo an biakte chu ka titâwp bawk ang. Aigupta ramah rorêl tûr tu mah an awm lo vang a, Aigupta mite chu an zâm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathros khua chu ka tiram ang a, Zoan khua pawh ka hâl ang a, No khua chu ka hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sin khua, Aigupta kulh ropui chhûngah chuan ka thinurna ka leih ang a, No khaw mite ka râwt vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aigupta ramah mei ka chhuah ang a, Sin khua chu an chiai ang a, No khua chu an darh ang a, a kulhte chu a chim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aven leh Pi-beset khaw tlangvâlte chu khandaihin an sât hlum ang a, mi dangte chu salah an hruai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aigupta chakna ka tihchhiata, an kulh chhuan, rinawm chu, ka tihchim hunah chuan Tahfanes khuaah chuan ni a thim ang a, chhûm thimin a khuh ang a, a chhûnga mite chu salah an hruai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aigupta ka hrem hun chuan Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kum sâwm leh pakhatna, thla khat, tahrik ni sarih ni-ah Lalpan ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Aigupta lal Farawa bân chu ka tihtliahsak a, a dam theih nân an tuam lo va, khandaih a lek leh theih nân ṭhem an dawhsak hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Aigupta lal Farawa bân ṭha lam, a tliak lo zâwk pawh chu ka tihtliahsak ang a, khandaih a chelh thei tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aigupta mite chu hnam tin zîngah ka tidarh ang a, ram tinah ka thawn darh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Babulon lal kut chu ka tichak ang a, a kutah ka khandaih ka dah ang a, Farawa bân chu ka tihtliahsak ang; a hmaah chuan a hliam tuar avâng chuan a rûm dur dur ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Babulon lal kut ka tihchaka, Farawa a tlâwm hunah chuan kei Lalpa hian Babulon lal kutah ka khandaih ka pe a, Aigupta ramah a lek ta a ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aigupta mite chu hnam tin zîngah ka tidarh ang a, ram tinah ka thawn darh ang; tichuan, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sâwm leh pakhatna, thla thum, tahrik ni khatah Lalpa chuan ka hnênah a sawi a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Aigupta lal Farawa leh ka mite hnênah heti hian ti rawh: I ropuizia eng nên nge ka teh ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lebanon tlâng Sidar a ni, Ṭawi luai, hlim nuam tak mai, A zîk sângin chhûm han tawng chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tlan tûr tui a tam a, Lei hnuai tui chuan a châwm lian a, A ṭona chu a tihnâwng a, Ngawa thing tinrêng châwm nân a luang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tui tlan a ṭhat êm avângin Thing dang aiin a ṭhang chak a, A buk a lianin a zârte pawh a sei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chunglêng savate chuan a bukah bu an chhep a, Ramsate chuan a buk hnuaiah no an nei, A hlimah chuan hnam tam tak an chêng bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A buk chu a mawiin a zâr duai a, A zung chuan hnianghnârin tui a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian huana sidar zîngah a tluk rêng an awm lo, Fârthingte lah a tluka buk an awm lo va, Thingse zârte pawhin a tluk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Buk mawi takin ka siam a ni, Pathian huan, Eden-a thing zawng zawngin an awt.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “A ṭhang chakin a buk lian a, a zîkte chuan chhûmte a tawng tâk avângin a chapo ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka hnâwl ta a ni; hnam dang lal hnênah ka pe ang a, thil sual a tih ang chu a chungah a rawn ti ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hnam râwng tak tak chuan an rawn kit ang a, tlângah leh kawrahte a zâr leh a ṭang tliak chu a awm nêlh nûlh ang. A hlima chêng ṭhîn hnamte chu an darh ang a, an kal bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thingluang chungah chuan savate an ṭum ang a, a zârte chu ramsaten an chîl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, tui ṭhatna hmuna thing rêng rêng, a tluka ṭhang chak leh sâng, chhûm tawnga ding luah, a awm leh tawh ngai lo vang. Mihringte anga thi mai tûr leh leilâwta chhuk vek tûrin ka ti tawh a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Seol-a a chhuk ni chuan lei hnuai tui chu amah sûn nân ka chawlhtîr ang a, lui luang chu ka titâwp ang a, tuihna luang chhuak a awm lo vang; Lebanon tlâng chu ka tingui ruai ang a, thingte chu an vuai zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Seol-a ka nam thlâk ni chuan a tla thâwmah hnamte chu an khûr ang a, Eden huan thing zawng zawng leh Lebanon thing ṭha ṭha, tui tamnaa ṭo, leilâwta tla tawhte chu, leilâwta a tlâk ve tâk avângin an lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khandaiha an sah hlumte zînga awm tûrin mitthi khuaah an chhuk dial ang. A hlima awm ṭhînte chu hnam tin zîngah an darh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Eden huanah, nang anga lian leh ropui a awm em ni? Eden huana thingte ang bawkin mitthi khuaah i chhuk ang a, khandaiha sah hlum, serh tan lohho zîngah chuan i awm ve ang. Chûng chu Farawa leh a hote an ni,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sâwm leh pahnihna, thla sâwm leh pahnih, ni khatah chuan Lalpan mi bia a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Aigupta leh Farawa sûnna tûr hla heti hian phuah rawh: Hnam tin zîngah sakeibaknei vânglai ang i ni a, Tuipuia awle, luia chêng chu i ni, I chhek bûrh bûrh a, i tinu zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Hnam tam tak an lo pun khâwm hunah, Ka lên ka zâr ang a, Lêna i âwk chu an hnûk chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khawmualah ka dah ang chia, Leichârah ka paih ang che. Chunglêng savate ka tlantîr ang chia, Ramsa zawng zawng ka titlai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I ruang ṭawih tawh chu Tlângah leh ruamah te ka tidarh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tlângah te i thisen ka leihbua ang a, I chênna lui te chu thisenin a khat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka tihboral hun che chuan vân ka khuh ang a, Arsi ka tithim ang. Ni chu chhûmin a hliah ang a, Thla pawh a êng hek lâwng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vâna êng awm zawng zawng ka tihthimsak ang chia, I ram chu a thim tlat ang, Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I chhiat thu ka hriat hun chuan Hnam tam tak an thlabâr ang a, I hriat loh rama awmte pawh an chiai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ni, mi tam tak an chiai ang a, An lalte pawh hlauvin an khûr ang. An hmaa khandaih ka vilik hunah i chhiat ni a lo thlen hun chuan Mi tin, thih ve hlauvin an khûr ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Babulon lal khandaih chu i tuar dâwn,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I mite chu hnam râwng takte khandaihin ka thahtîr ang. Aigupta thil chhuanvâwrte chu An tichhia ang a, an tiboral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tui tamna hmuna ran tlate chu ka tihlum vek ang. Tu mah an kal tawh lo vang a, Rante pawhin an dai nu tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A tuite chu ka tlin fîmtîr ang a, Luite chu ka luantîr dem dem ang, Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aigupta ram chu ka tiram ang a, A chhûnga awm zawng zawng pawh an thah hunah Kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hei hi amah an sûnna hla a la ni ang: Hnam tinrêng hmeichhiate chuan Aigupta leh a mite chu He hla hian an ṭah ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum sâwm leh pahnihna, thla khatna, ni sâwm leh panga ni chuan Lalpan min bia a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Aigupta mite tân ṭap rawh; hnam dang chak tak tak, mitthi khuaa chhuk tawhte hnênah chhuktîr la, heti hian ti ang che:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu aiin nge i mawi zâwk le? Serh tan lohho nêna awm tûrin chhuk rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aigupta mite chu indonaa thite zîngah an thi ve ang, That vek tûrin khandaih a inpeih ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Seol-a kal tawh, an pasalṭhate chuan Farawa an lo lâwm a, ‘Amah ṭanpuitu, serh tan lohho, indonaa thite chu An lo chhuk ve ta a, an thal dêr mai,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tah chuan Asuria pawh, a mite nên an awm ve a, khandaiha thite thlân chuan A thlân an hual tuau mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An thlânte chu lei hnuai thûkah chuan a awm a, A mite chu khandaiha thi an ni, A thlân vêlah an awm tuau mai, Mi nung ram tiralṭi ṭhîntute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tah chuan Elam pawh a awm a, A mite chuan a thlân an hual tuau mai. An za chuan khandaiha thi an ni. Lei hnuai khurah an chhuk thla ta, serh tan lohhote chu. Mi nung ram tirâlṭi ṭhîntute an ni. Khur thûkah chuan mualpho takin an chhuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Elam chu khandaiha thahte zîngah a zâl ve a, A ni, serh tan loh, khandaiha thite chuan A thlân an hual. Mi nung ram tirâlṭi ṭhîntute an ni, Thi tawh zîngah an awm ve ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tah chuan Mesek leh Tubal thlân pawh An mite thlânin a hual tuau mai. Serh tan loh vek an ni, thah vek an ni, Mi nung ram tirâlṭi ṭhîntute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hmânlai pasalṭhate angin phûm an hlawh lo, Seol-ah râlthuam nên an chhuak, An khandaih an lukham a, An phaw inkhuh nân an hmang. Hêng mi huaite hi mi nung ram tirâlṭi ṭhîntute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aigupta pawh a chhiat hnu chuan Serh tan lohho zîngah khandaiha thahte zîngah a zâl ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Edom lal pawh, an miliante nên, ropui hle ṭhîn mah se, mitthi khuaah chuan an chhuk a; serh tan loh, khandaiha thahte nên an mu dul mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hmâr lama mi lian zawng zawng leh Sidon mi zawng zawng pawh tah chuan an awm. An chak avângin miin an hlau ṭhîn chu an inzahpui ang a, serh tan lohho, khandaiha thahte nên, mualpho takin mitthi khuaah an chhuk ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Chûng mite chu Farawa leh a sipai, khandaiha thite chuan an lo hmuhin an thin a dam tawh ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Farawa leh a mi, mi nung ram tirâlṭi ṭhîntute chu serh tan lohho, khandaiha thahte zîngah an mu ve ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, mite hnênah heti hian sawi rawh: Ram chhûnga indona ka thlentîr dâwnin an zînga mi pakhat râlvêngtuah ruat sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chu mi chuan ral lo kal a hmuh chuan mi dang an inrâlrin nân tawtawrâwt a hâm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu-in emaw tawtawrâwt ri chu hriain ngaihsak lo sela; hriattîrna chu a pawisak loh avângin râl chuan rawn that mah se, ama thiam loh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tawtawrâwt ri chu a hria a, a inring duh lo va, a thihna chu ama mawh a ni ang; inring sela chuan thih a pumpelh thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Râlvêngtu chuan râl lo kal hmuin tawtawrâwt hâm lo sela, mi an inrâlring lo vang a, râl chuan mi tu pawh rawn that sela, suala thi a ni a; mahse, a thisen phuba chu râlvêngtu chungah ka la ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tichuan, nang mihring fapa, Israel chhûngte vêngtuah ka ruat a che. Ka thu i hriat ang ang chu an inrâlrinna tûrin hrilh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi sual chu a thi ang ka tiha, a nun hum tûra a lamlêt theih nân i hrilh lâwk si loh chuan a sualna avângin a thi ngei ang; a thihna mawh erawh chu i chungah ka nghat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi sual chu i hrilh lâwka, a sual luih zêl erawh chuan a sualna avâng chuan a thi ang, nang erawh chu i fihlîm ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Nang, Mihring fapa, Israel chhûngte hrilh rawh: ‘Kan bawhchhiatna leh kan sualnate chuan min delh a, chûng avâng chuan kan chau zo va, engtin nge kan nun theih ang?’ an ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Heti hian hrilh rawh: ‘Mi nung ka ni, Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.’ Mi sualte thih hi ka lawmzâwng em ni? An lamlêta an nun asin ka duh. Mi sualte u, lamlêt ula, lo hawi kîr teh u, Israel chhûngte u, engah nge in thih mai ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Nang, mihring fapa, i mite hrilh rawh: Mi ṭhain thil sual a tih chuan a ṭhatna chuan a chhanhim thei lo vang. Mi sualin thil sual tih a sim chuan a sualna chu a chhiat phah lo vang. Mi ṭha pawhin thil sual a tih chuan a nung thei chuang lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi ṭha chu a nung ngei ang ti mah ila, a ṭhatna chu tâwka a ngaiha, thil sual a tih chuan, a ṭhatna chu hriat reng a ni lo vang a, thil sual a tih avâng chuan a thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Mi sual chu a thi ngei ang ti mah ila, a sual chu a sima,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />dahkhamte a kîr ṭhina, a thil rûkte a pêk kîra, thil sual ti lova nun theihna tûr ka Dân a zawm chuan a thi lo vang, a nung ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thil dik leh ṭha a tih avângin a thil sual tih ṭhin kha ka hre reng lo vang a, a nung ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“I mite chuan ‘ Lalpa awm dân hi a mumal lo,’ an ti a, an awm dân a mumal lo zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi ṭha chuan a ṭhatna a bansâna, thil sual a tih chuan a sual avâng chuan a thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi sual chuan a sima, thil ṭha leh dik a tih chuan chumi avâng chuan a nung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mahse, nangni chuan, ‘ Lalpa awm dân hi a mumal lo,’ in ti ṭhîn. Israel chhûngte u, in thil tih ang zêlin in chungah ro ka rêlsak dâwn che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kan saltân kum sâwm leh pahnihna, thla sâwm, ni nga ni chuan Jerusalem aṭanga tlân chhuak a lo thleng a, khawpui chu râlin an la ta tih min rawn hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chu mi lo thlen dâwn zân chuan Lalpan mi rawn khawih a, a lo thleng zînga be thei tûrin min ṭawng theihtîr a, ṭawng thei lovin ka awm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel ram khawpui chhiaa awmte chuan, ‘Abrahama, mi pakhat mai mah, ram hi a puma pêk a nih chuan, keini chu tam tak kan la ni a, ram pum hi kan ta tûr a ni ang chu,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti ti rawh: Sa chu a thisen nên in ei a, milem in bia a, thisen in chhuah bawk a, ram hi in chang ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />In khandaih in ring a, thil tenawm in ti a, mahni ṭhenawm nupui in tibawrhbâng a, ram hi in chang ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hrilh rawh, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Mi nung ka nih hi,’ Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti. Khaw rama awmte chu khandaiha sah hlum an ni ang a, tâmlaka awmte chu sa-in a seh ang a, ramhnuai leh pûka birute chu hripuiin an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ram chu namên lovin ka tichhia ang a, an chakna an chhuan êm êm ṭhinte chu ka titâwp ang. Israel rama tlângte chu a ram vek ang a, tu mah an kal ngam lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thil tenawm an tih avânga ram chu ka tihchhiat vek hunah kei hi Lalpa ka ni tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Nang, Mihring fapa, i mite chuan kulh bang bulah te, kawngkhâr bulah te an intawhna apiangah i chungchâng an sawi noh noh mai. Heti hian an ti: ‘Ti rawh u, Lalpa thu a hril chu i va ngaithla teh ang,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka mite ni âwm rêngin i thu ngaithla tûrin an lo kal khâwm a, an ṭhu a. Thu chu an ngaithla a, an zâwm duh si lo. An kam chauh a ṭha a, hma an sial êm êm si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hla lênglâwng sak thiam tak leh ṭingṭang tum thiam tak ang lekah an ngai che a ni. I thu chu an hria a; mahse, an zâwm duh si lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />I thu lo thleng ngei tûr a lo thlen hunah an zîngah zâwlnei a lo awm takmeuh mai tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel-te vêngtu, berâmpuho demin thu sawi la, thu puang rawh. Berâmpuho hnênah chuan heti hian ti ang che: Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Israel berâmpuho, mahni inhrai tlaite tak hi chu aw! Berâmpu chuan a berâmte a châwm tûr a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In ran thau in ei a, an hmul in sin a, a chum chum in talh a, berâm rual in châwm duh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A sawngnawi in enkawl lo va, an nate intidam lo va, an hliam in tuam lo va, an tlânchhe darh in hruai khâwm lo va, a bo in zawng hek lo, an chungah râwng takin thil in ti zâwk si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pu an neih loh avângin berâmte chu an darh a, ram sakawlh tinrêngin a darhte chu an seh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka berâmte chu tlâng sângah te, mual lian takah te an bo va, tâmlakah te an darh a, tu man an zawng lo va, an lam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Chuvângin, berâmpute u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla teh u, ‘Mi nung ka nih hi,’ Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vêngtu an neih loh avângin ka berâmte chu seh mai theihin an awm a, ram sakawlh tinrêngin an ei a, berâmpute chuan an berâmte an zawng khâwm duh lo va, berâm châwm lovin anmahni chauh an inchâwm a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, berâmpute u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Berâmpute u, ka va haw tak che u êm! Ka berâmte chu ka chhuhsak ang che u a, in enkawl leh tawh lo vang. In kut aṭangin ka berâmte chu ka chhan chhuak ang a, mahni chauh inchâwmin an sa in ei leh tawh lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Kei ngei hian ka berâmte chu ka zawng ang a, ka lam khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Berâm darhte berâmpuin a lam khâwm ang hian kei pawhin ka berâmte chu, khaw dur ni leh thim tak an tawh laia an darhna ram tin ata ka lam khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hnam dang mite ram ata ka la khâwm ang a, ram tin ata ka khâwm ang a, an ramah ka hruai ang; Israel tlângramah te, lui kamah te, hmun nuamah te ka tlattîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hnim ṭhatna phûlah ka tlattîr ang a, Israel tlângram ṭhaah an awm ang, tah chuan huang an nei ang. Huangah chuan an bawk ang a, tlânga hnim ṭha ṭha chu an tlân ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka berâmte chu keimah ngeiin ka châwm ang a, bawhna tûr ka siamsak ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“A bo chu ka zawng ang a, a tlânchhe darh chu ka khalh khâwm ang a, an hliamte chu ka tuam ang a, a sawngnawite chu duat takin ka enkawl ang. A thau leh chakte chu ka vêng ang a, a tâwk têin chaw ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Nangni ka berâmte u, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Berâm leh berâm inkâr thu te, berâm leh kêl inkâr thute ka rêl fel dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hnim ṭha ṭha in pet a, in peh sên loh in chîl chhia hi thil na mai em ni? Tui in in lahin a fîm in in a, in in sên loh in dai nu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka berâm dangte chuan in chîl chhiat hnu an pet a, in dai nut hnu chauh in tûr an hmu.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan an hnênah heti hian a ti: “Berâm chak leh chak lo inkâr thu ka rêl dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A chak lo chu in nêk per a, in nawr kiang a, a rual zîng ata in phîn darh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka berâmte chu ka chhan dâwn a ni; seh mai theiha an awm ka phal lo vang. Ka berâmte chungthu, a mal malin, ka rêlsak ang a, a ṭha leh ṭha lo ka thliar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vêngtu pakhat ka ruatsak ang a, ka chhiahhlawh Davida ang an lalah ka pe ang a, ani chu an vêngtu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kei Lalpa hi an Pathian ka ni ang a, ka chhiahhlawh Davida ang chu an hruaitu a ni ang; kei Lalpa hian ka sawi tawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thlamuang taka an awm theih nân remna thu ka thlunpui ang a, ram sakawlh zawng zawng ka hnawt bo vang a, ram rehah te thlamuang takin an awm ang a, ngaw hnuaiah pawh an mu chiah chiah thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Mal ka sâwm ang a, ka tlâng vêlah ka awmtîr ang. A hun takah an tân malsâwm ruah ka surtîr bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thei kûngte chu ka tirah ang a, lovah thlai a ṭha ang a, mahni ram ṭheuhvah thlamuang takin an awm ang. An nghâwngkawl ka tihtliahsaka, chhiahhlawha neitute kut ata ka chhan chhuah hunah kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hnam dangte man mai mai tûr an ni tawh lo vang a, ramsate pawhin an seh tawh lo vang. Thlamuang takin an awm ang a, an thlaphâng tawh ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An buh leh thlai ka tihhlâwksak ang a, ṭâm an hre tawh lo vang a, hnam dangin an hmusit tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Israel chhûngte hi ka mite an ni a, kei Lalpa hi an Pathian ka ni tih tu pawhin an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Nangni berâm rual, ka berâm châwmte u, ka mite in ni a, kei hi in P athian ka nih hi,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a sawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Seir tlâng lam hawi la, thu puan khum rawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Seir tlâng, ka hua a che, I chungah ka kut ka lek ang a, Ka tiram vek ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I khuate chu a chim chhe vek ang a, A ram hlauh vang. Tichuan, Lalpa chu ka ni tih i hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Israel fate kumkhaw hmêlma i ni a, an mangan lai tak, an sual tâwpa hrem an nih lai khân thah râl vek tûrin i hawisan vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Mi nung ka nih hi,’ Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti; chuvângin, i thisen a chhuak dâwn, i thisen zawmpuite i hua a, thisenin a ûm dâwn a che, i thi ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Seir tlângte chu ka tichim vek dâwn, a chunga veivâk apiang ka tihlum vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tlâng leh mualte chu ruangin ka tikhat ang a, ruamahte chuan khandaiha thi an lum phung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chhe hlen hlauh tûr i ni, i khawpuite pawh tu man an luah lo vang; tichuan, Lalpa chu ka ni tih i hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei Lalpa hi ka awm chhûngin, ‘Hêng hnam pahnih leh an ramte hi ka ta a ni, ka nei dâwn,’ i ti vei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi nung ka nih hi,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti. “Chuvângin, anmahni i huata, an chunga i thinura, i îtsîk ang hian i chungah ka che ve ang. An chunga i thiltih avângin ka hrem dâwn che a ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“ ‘Israel tlângte chu a chim ta a, kan duh duha sawisak theih a ni ta,’ tia i hmuhsit êm êmzia kha ka lo hria tih i hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka chunga chapo taka i ṭawng thâwng thâwng kha ka hria asin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka tiram hneh khawp ang chia, i chhiat avângin khawvêl an lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka mi, Israel ṭiau i hmuh laia i lâwm ang khân i chungah ka che ve ang. Seir tlâng chu, Edom ram pum pui nên, a ram vek dâwn. Tichuan, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Nang, Mihring fapa, Israel tlâng chungthu puang la, heti hian ti rawh: Israel ram tlângte u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Hmêlmate chuan, ‘Chei! Hmunsâng, hmun hlunte chu kan ta a ni ta,’ an ti vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, thu sawi khum rawh: Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: In vêla hnamte chuan in ram chu an neih theih nân an sawisa che u a, an tiram che u a, an chêksawlh che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuvângin, Israel tlângte u, Lalpa P athian thu hi ngaithla teh u: tlâng te, mual te, kawr te, hmun ṭiau leh ram te, rauhsan leh rawk tâwk khawpui te, an vêla hnam dangten an chêksawlhte hnênah Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan, Ka ṭhahnemngai thinrimin an vêla awm hnam dangte demin thu ka sawi a ni. Edom phei chu ka dem zual a ni. Hlim takin ka ram chu an nuihzat a, neih tumin an insem a, ran tlatna chu an nei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Chuvângin, Israel ram chungthu puang la, tlâng te, mual te, lui te, kawr hnênah te heti hian sawi ang che: Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Hnam dangin an tihmualpho che u avângin ka ṭhahnemngai thinrimin thu ka sawi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: In vêla awm hnam dangte chungah ka kut ka lek ta, an mualpho dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel tlângah te erawh chuan thingte chu a duah hluah hluah ang a, ka mi Israel-te tân a rah tiar tuar ang; an lo kîr leh hun chu a hnai tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai teh, in lamṭang ka nih hi, in lam ka hawi ang a, in lote chu in let ang a, thlai in chîng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel chhûngte chu ka tipung ang a, khaw ram tawhte chu in luah leh ang a, in chei hnûm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In zîngah mihring leh ran an pung ang a, fa in ngahin in pung chak hle ang. Tûn hmaa in awm dân angin in awm leh ang a, ka tihmuingîl lehzual ang che u; tichuan, Lalpa ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka mi, Israel-te chu ka hruai kîr ang a, ram chu an luah ang a, an nei leh ang, a ram tawh ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘He ram hi mihring heh ram a ni, an fate an sûn zêl mai,’ an ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mahse, ‘Mihring heh ram, fate sûnna ram,’ an ti tawh lo vang, Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hnam dang hmuhsitna ri an hre tawh lo vang a, an rawn timualpho hek lo vang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel chhûngte hian an rama an awm chhûngin an khawsak dân leh an thil tih dânin ram chu an tibawrhbâng a, hmeichhe fel loh lai angin ka hmaah an bawlhhlawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ram chhûnga thisen an chhuah ṭhin avâng leh milema an intihbawrhbân ṭhin avângin an chungah ka thinur ka leih bua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hnam dang zîngah ka thawn darh a, ram tinah ka tidarh a, an awm dân leh thiltih dân angin ka hrem a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mahse, an kalna ram apiangah ka hming thianghlim an tichhe zêl si a. ‘Hêng mite hi Lalpa mite an ni a; mahse, an awmna ram ata hnawh chhuah an ni,’ an lo ti zêl si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel chhûngte kalna ram apianga ka hming a chhiat zui zêl avângin ka hming thianghlim chu ka lainat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel chhûngte chu hrilh rawh: Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Ka thil tih tum hi Israel chhûngte ka khawngaih vânga tih tum ka ni lo; ka hming thianghlim vânga tih tum ka ni, an kalna ram apiangah ka hming a chhe zui zêl si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka hming thianghlim ropuizia hi hnam tin zîngah ka tilang dâwn; nangmahni avângin an zîngah ka hming a chhe ta si a; chûng mite chuan kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hre tûr a ni: Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti; ka thianghlimzia an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hnam dang zîng ata ka la chhuak ang a, ram tin ata ka hruai khâwm ang a, an ram ka thlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tui thianghlim an chungah ka leih ang a, an bawlhhlawhna ka tifai ang a, an milemte lakah ka tifihlîm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thinlung thar leh rilru thar ka pe ang a, an thinlung, lung anga sak chu ka la bo vang a, thinlung nêm, tisa anga nêm chu ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An kawchhûngah ka Thlarau ka dah ang a, ka dânte an zâwm ang a, ka thupêkte awihin an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An pate ka pêk ramah chuan an chêng ang a, ka mite an ni ang a, kei hi an P athian ka ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An bawhchhiatna ata ka chhan chhuak ang a, an buh leh bâl ka tihhlâwksak ang a, ṭâm an tuar tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An thei kûngte ka tirah ang a, an lova thlaite ka ti ṭha ang, ṭâm avângin hnam dangten an hmusit tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An awm dân ṭhat lohzia an hre chhuak ang a, an sualna avâng leh thil tenawm an tih ṭhin avângin anmahni an inten ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nangmahni avânga hêng hi ti ka ni lo ve, Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti. Aw Israel chhûngte u, in awm dân avânga zak leh mualpho in ni tih in hriat ka duh a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “In bawlhhlawhna ka tihfai hunah in khuaah te ka awmtîr leh ang che u a, a chim chhiate chu in din thar leh dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A kal apiang hmuha hnim ber bur tawh, in lote chu in let leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />‘He huan, ram daih tawh hi Eden huan ang zu ni leh ta a! Khaw chhe tawh, chim rem rum, an rauhsan tawh kha kulha inhungin an luah leh tâk hi!’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A vêla hnam la awmte chuan kei Lalpa hian khaw chhe chim tawhte leh ram tawhte chu ka din thar leh a ni tih an hria ang; kei Lalpa hian ka sawi angin ka ti a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Israel chhûngte tân ka inhawng tawh ang a, berâm rual angin ka tipung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kût nikhuaa an berâm hlan tûr Jerusalem khuaa a khat angin khaw chhe tawhahte mihring an khat ang; tichuan, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a kutin min vuan a, Lalpa Thlarau chuan min hruai a, ruamah min dah a. Ruam chu ruhin a khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ruamah chuan min hruai kual a, a ruam dâpin ruh chu a awm a, ruh ro tak tak hlîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, hêng ruhte hi an lo nung leh thei ang em?” min ti a. Kei chuan, “Lalpa P athian , nangin i hria alâwm,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Hêng ruh chungchâng thu hi puang la, ruh ro hnênah heti hian sawi rawh: ‘ Lalpa thu ngaithla teh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />hêng ruh rote hnênah hian Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Ngai teh u, ka rawn chhêm ang che u a; tichuan, in nung leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thahrui ka pe ang che u a, vunin a khuh ang che u. Ka thâwk khum ang che u a; tichuan, in nung leh ang; kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thu min pêk ang chuan ka ti a; thu ka puan lai chuan thâwm ri rawk rawk ka hria a, ruhte chu an zawmpuite nên chuan an inchuktuah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka en reng a, thahrui a lo awm a, tisain a tuam a, vunin a khuh ta ṭheuh va, mahse an la thaw thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hnênah chuan, “Mihring fapa, thli hnênah thu puang la, heti hian thli chu hrilh rawh: kâwlkil li-a thlite u, lo kal ula, hêng mi thah ruangte hi han chhêm ula, lo nung rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thu min pêk ang chuan ka puang a, thli chuan a rawn chhêm a, an nung a, an ding ta a, sipai rual tam zet an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Heti hian mi ti a: “Mihring fapa, Israel chhûngte hi hêng ruh ro ang hi an ni, ‘Kan ruhte a ro zo ta, beisei a bo va, tihduhdah kan nih hi,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, an hnênah heti hian puang rawh: Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: An thlânte chu ka hawng ang a, thlân aṭangin ka mite chu ka la chhuak ang a, Israel ramah ka hruai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An thlân ka hawna, ka lâk chhuah hunah chuan kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anmahniah ka Thlarau ka dah ang a, an nung ang a, an ramah ka hruai ang. Kei Lalpa hian ka sawi ang ngeiin ka ti tih an hria ang,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nang, Mihring fapa, tiang pakhat la la, tah chuan, ‘Juda leh a thurualpui Israel fate,’ tih ziak rawh. Tiang dang pakhat la leh la, tah chuan, ‘Efraim tiang - Josefa leh a thurualpui Israel chhûngte tân,’ tih ziak bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tiang pakhat ni âwm takin a hmâwr pahnih chu hum zawm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I mite chuan, ‘Hei hi eng tihna nge, min hrilh teh,’ an tih che chuan heti hian ti ang che:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />‘Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Ngai teh u, Josefa tiang, Efraim kuta awm, a thurualpui Israel chite chu Juda tiang nên ka hum kawp ang a, tiang pakhatah ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An hmuh atân tiang i ziak pahnihte chu hum kawp ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An hnênah, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti, ti rawh: Ngai teh u, kei ngei hian Israel fate chu an kalna ram hnam dang zîng ata ka la khâwm dâwn; kil tin aṭangin ka hruai chhuak ang a, an ramah ka thlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An ram, Israel tlângahte chuan hnam khatah ka siam ang a, rorêl tûr lal pakhat an nei ang a, hnam hnih leh ram hnih ni ṭhîn chu an inṭhen tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Milemte leh thil tenawm an tihte leh an bawhchhiatnate chuan an intibawrhbâng tawh lo vang a, an sual ṭhinna hmun ata chu ka chhan chhuak ang a, ka tifai ang; tichuan, ka mite an ni ang a, kei pawh an tân Pathian ka ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawh Davida ang lal an nei ang a, rorêltu pakhat hnuaiah an awm ang. Dik taka rorêlin ka Dân an awihin an zâwm ang a, an ti bawk ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ka chhiahhlawh Jakoba hnêna ka pêk ram, an pate awmna ramah chuan an awm ang. Tah chuan an chêng reng ang, an fa te, an tu te, an tuchhuan te thlengin an awm kumkhua tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thlamuang taka an awm theih nân kumkhaw remna thu ka thlunpui ang. Ka tinghet ang a, anni chu ka tipung ang a, ka hmun thianghlim chu an zîngah ka awmtîr kumkhua ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An zîngah ka chêng ang a, an tân Pathian ka ni ang a, ka mite an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An zînga kumkhuaa awm tûr, ka hmun thianghlim, an zînga ka dah hunah chuan hnam dangte pawhin kei Lalpa hian Israel-te hi ka mi atân ka thlang tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mi bia a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Magog rama Mesek leh Tubal hruaitu lian ber, Goga lam hawi la, thu sawi khum rawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Heti hian ti ang che: Lalpa P athian chuan Mesek leh Tubal hruaitu lian ber Goga hnênah heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hua che a ni, ka tuai vir ang chia, i khabe-ah nghakuaiin ka kuai ang chia, i sipai rual te, sakawr leh sakawr chungchuang nalh tak taka inchei te, mi tam tak, awmphaw ha leh phaw keng, khandaih keng te nên ka hnûk chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I hote chu Persia mi te, Kus mi te leh Put mi te an ni; phaw leh dâr lukhum an za-in an nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gomer leh hmâr tâwpa awm Beth-togarma rama indo thiamte chuan an zui che, hnam dang zînga sipai rual tam tak pawh an tel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In peih la, i hote pawh inrâlring sela, vêng ngun rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ni eng emaw zât hnuah ka chhawr dâwn che a ni. Kum tam fe a ral hnuah hnam tam tak zînga darh ka hruai khâwmte thlamuang taka an awm tawhna, khandaih laka chhan ram, Israel tlângram chhe tawh leh ram tawh, thlamuang taka an awm leh tawhna ram chu, i rûn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thlipui thawk buan buan angin sipai leh i ṭhuihruaite nên in bei ang a, ram chu chhûm ang maiin in tuam dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Chumi hnuah chuan thil ṭha lo tak tih i rilrûk ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Kulh pawh nei hlei lo ramah chuan ka kal teh ang, kulh nei lo, a khârna leh kalhna pawh awm lo khuaahte thlamuang takin an chêng der der a, ka rûn dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khaw chhe tawha chêngte chu ka rawk ang a, ka suam ang,’ i ti vei a. Chûng mite chu hnam tin zînga darh tawh hruai khâwm leh an ni a, ran leh sum an nei leh ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Seba leh Dedan mite leh Tarsis sumdâwngtute chuan, ‘Rawk tûr leh suam tûrin i sipaite i khâwm em ni? An tangka leh rangkachak te, an ran te leh sum te chhuhsakin hawn ṭeuh i tum em ni?’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Chuvângin, Mihring fapa, thu puang la, Goga chu hrilh rawh: Ka mi Israel-te chu thlamuang taka an awm laiin i bei ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />hmâr tâwp, i awmna ram aṭang chuan mi tam tak, sakawr chungchuang rual leh sipai rual nên i thawk chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chhûmin ram a tuam angin ka mi Israel-te chu i tuam ang a, a hun ka tihah chuan. Aw Goga, ka ram chu ka rûntîr ang che, hnam tinin tu nge ka nih an hmuha ka thianghlimzia a lan theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Israel zâwlneite hmanga ka lo sawi daih tawh, ‘Israel-te bei tûrin mi tu emaw ka rawn hruai dâwn’ ka tih kha i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Goga chu Israel ram bei tûra a lo kal hunah ka thinur hle ang, Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thinur chuan, ‘Israel ramah, chumi ni chuan, lîr nasa takin ka tinghîng ang,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tlângte a min ang a, khâmte a chim ang a, kulh bang te a chim ang; thih hlauvin tuipui sangha te, chunglêng sava te, ramsa te, bawkvâka kal te leh rama mihring awmte chu, ka hmaah chuan an khûr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah bei tûrin khandaih ka ruai ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti. “A mite chu khandaihin an inbei tawn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ruahpuivânâwn leh rial ka chhuttîr ang a, a kalpui sipaite leh a ṭhuihruai tam takte chungah kâta kâng mei ka sûrtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, hnam tin hmuhah ka ropuizia leh thianghlimzia ka tilang ang a, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Nang, Mihring fapa, Goga chu thu sawi khum rawh. Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Mesek leh Tubal hotu lian ber, Goga, ka hua che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka tuai vir ang chia, ka hnûk ang che. Hmâr tâwp aṭangin ka la chhuak ang che a, Israel tlângah ka hruai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I kut vei lama thalngul chu ka titliak ang a, i ding lama thal chu ka tibung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Goga leh a sipaite, a ṭhuihruaite nên chuan Israel tlângah an thi ang a, an ruang chu ramsa leh chunglêng sava ka tlantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ram dâpin an tlu pheng phung ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Magog ramah leh tuipui kam, thlamuang taka an awmna ramah chuan, mei ka tichhuak ang a, mi tinin Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mi, Israel-te chu, ka hming thianghlim ka hriattîr ang a, ka hming thianghlim chu anmahni avângin a chhe tawh lo vang. Hnam dangte chuan Israel Mi Thianghlima ka ni tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, ka hun sawi chu a lo hnai e, a thleng mai dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel khuaa awmte chuan râlthuam tinrêng, phaw te, awmphaw te, thalngul te, thal te, talhtum te leh fei te chu thingah an fawm ang a, tuahah an hmang ang, kum sarih tla a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thingtuah phur tûrin an ramah emaw, ngawa thing kit tûrin emaw an thawk chhuak ngai lo vang. Râlthuam tlâwmsan chu thingtuahah an hmang dâwn a ni. Anmahni rawktu chu an rawk ang a, suamtu chu an suam ve thung dâwn a ni,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Chumi hnuah chuan, Tuipui Thi chhak lama awm Abarim ruam an tih, Israel ramah chuan, Goga thlân hmun ka pe ang, chutah chuan Goga leh a ṭhuihruaite chu an phûm ang. Chu chuan khualzinte a dang ang a, ‘Hamon Gog ruam’ an vuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ram a thian theih nân thla sarih chhûngin Israel-te chuan an phûm zo hrâm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Phûmnaah chuan rama awm zawng zawng an thawk ang a, ka ropuina ni a thlen hunah chawimawi an ni ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Thla sarih a ral hnu chuan, ram pum fang chhuak tûr, ruang phûm loh a awm emaw tih zawnga hnaa neih tûr mi an ruat ang. Chutiang chuan ram chu an thian fai dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûng mite chuan an kal velnaah mihring ruh an hmuh phawt chuan a bulah chhinchhiahna an târ ang a, thlân laitute chuan an phûm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi bulah chuan khaw pakhat, Hamona tih a awm. Tichuan, ram chu a lo thiang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Nang, Mihring fapa, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: chunglêng sava te leh ramsa te chu hrilh rawh: lo kal sela, kil tin aṭangin lo kal khâwmin inthawina ruai ropui ka buatsaihah hian sa han ei sela, thisen han in rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi huaisen sa te in ei ang a, ram hruaitute thisen in in dâwn nia; berâm te, berâmno te, kêl te, bâwngchal te leh Basan ran chum te inthawi nân ka talh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ka ruai buatsaiha sa thaute chu êleuhvin in ei ang a, thisente chu rui khawpin in in ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka dawhkâna sakawr leh a chungchuang, mi huaite leh indo thiamte sa chu duh tâwkin in ei ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Hnam tin hnênah ka ropuizia ka tilang ang a, ka rorêl tâk dân chu an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chumi ni aṭang chuan Israel chhûngte chuan kei hi Lalpa , an Pathian chu ka ni tih an hre tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka chunga thil an tihsual avângin Israel-te chu salah ka tântîr a nih hnam dangte chuan an hria ang; ka chungah an rinawm lo va, ka hawisan ta a, khandaihah an thi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An bawlhhlawhna leh an bawhchhiatna avângin ka hrem a, ka hawisan a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuvangin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Jakoba saltâng chu ka hruai chhuak ang a, Israel chhûngte chu ka khawngaih ang; ka hming thianghlim chu ka humhalh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu man rawn tibuai lova anmahni ram ngeia thlamuang taka an awm hunah chuan min hawisan avânga an mualphona chu an theihnghilh thei tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka thianghlimzia tilang tûrin an hmêlmate awmna ram ata ka hruai khâwm ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />hnam tin zîngah sala thawn darha, an ramah ngei hruai kîr leha, tu mah hruai hmaih nei lotu an Pathian Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka hawisan tawh lo vang a, Israel chhûngte chungah ka Thlarau ka leih ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sala kan tân kum sawmhnih leh pangana, Jerusalem an lâk aṭanga kum sâwm leh pali, kum thar, ni sâwm ni chuan Lalpa chuan a kutin min chelh a, min hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Inlârnaah chuan Pathianin Israel ramah min hruai a, tlâng sâng takah min dah a, ka hmaah chuan khawpui din thar ni âwm tak ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutah chuan min hruai a, dâr tle anga lang mi pakhat ka hmu a, hrui leh tehna tiang a keng a, kawngka bulah a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu mi chuan ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, ngun takin en la, ngaithla rawh; ka entîr tûr zawng zawng che hi chhinchhiah tlat rawh: chumi atân chuan hetah hian ka hruai che a ni. I hmuh zawng zawng hi Israel chhûngte i hrilh tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hmuh chu Tempul a lo ni a; a vêlin bang a awm a. Tehna tiang a ken chu metar thuma sei a ni: bang chhah lam leh sân lam chu a han teh a, tiang tlûk khat ve ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khawchhak lam aṭanga luhna rahkaah chuan a chho va, rahka tâwpah chuan zâwl, tehna tiang tlûk khata zau a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Luh zêlna sîr tuakah chuan vênbûk pathum ve ve a awm a, vênbûk dung leh vâng chu a inchen a, tiang tlûk khat a ni. Vênbûk inkâr bang chu tawng ruka chhah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vênbûk chhûng ber aṭangin luh zêlna chu tiang tlûk khata thui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chumi dawtah chuan veranda, a chhûng thlâk tawng riat a awm a, ban tawng hnih biala lian a awm leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khawchhak lam han thlîr lêt chuan luhna sîr tuaka vênbûk awm chu a intiat vek a, an inkâr bang chhah lam pawh a inang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Luhna zau lam chu a han teh a, tawng sâwm leh pathuma zau a ni a, ban awmna laiah erawh chuan tawng sâwma zau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vênbûk luhna bang bulṭhut chu, tawng khata chhah, tawng khata sângin an tipâwng a, bang bul chu luhna sîr tuakah tawng ruk zêl a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vênbûk in ep, châr bang ve ve inkâr chu tawng sawmhnih leh panga a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Luhna leh chhuahna ban chu tawng sawmruk vêla sângah a ngai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Luhna tawntirh aṭanga hung chhûng lama chhuahna inkâr chu tawng sawmngaa thui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vênbûk chhûng châr lam bangah chuan tukverh tê a awm a, a sîr bangah pawh a awm ve ve a, kalna hrûl pindan bangah chuan tûm kûng lem an ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hung chhûng tualah chuan mi hruai a, pâwn lam pang bang ringin pindan sawmthum a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chûng pindan tual chhuat chu lung rem vek a ni, chuanhnuai tual zawng zawng nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuanchunga luhna leh chuanhnuaia chhuahna inkâr chu a teh a, tawng za a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hmâr lam aṭanga luhnaah chuan mi hruai leh a, luhna thui zâwng leh a zau lam chu a teh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Luhna sîr tuaka vênbûk pathum awm ve ve te, an inkâr bang leh a bang ṭhut pâwng bîk te, a ban leh a ban inkâr te chu khawchhak lam aṭanga luhna ang chiah kha a ni; tawng sawmngaa thui, a zau lam tawng sawmhnih leh panga a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukverh tê te, luhna tawntirh ban te, tûm kûng lem te pawh khawchhak lam aṭanga luhnaa mi ang kha a ni. A luh tirhnaah ban a awm a, rahka pasarih a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuanhnuai tual luhna zâwnah chuanchung luhna a awm bawk a, an inkâr chu a teh a, tawng za a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chhim lamah min hruai leh a, chutah pawh chuan luhna a awm a, a dang ang bawkin bante chu a the a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukverh tê te, bang bul pâwng bîk te a awm ve vek a; luhna thui zâwng pawh tawng sawmnga a ni a, a zau zâwng pawh tawng sawmhnih leh panga a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Luh chhohnaah rahka pasarih a awm a, ban te a awm a, banga tûm kûng lem ziak te, luhna sîr tuaka awmte pawh chu a inang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuanhnuai luhna leh chuanchung luhna inkâr pawh a teh a, tawng za bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chhim lam aṭanga luhna kal tlangin chuanchung luhnaah chuan min hruai a, chuanhnuai luhna ang bawk kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Vênbûk te, bang te, luhna bul ban te, banga tukverh tê te a awm ve vek a, tawng sawmngaa thui, sawmhnih leh pangaa zau bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Veranda dung chu tawng sawmhnih leh panga a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng nga a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Banahte leh bangahte chuan tûm kûng lem ziak a ni a, a hnuai aṭanga chuanchung lâwn chhohna rahka chu pariat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khawchhak lam aṭanga luhna kal tlangin chuanchung luhnaah min hruai leh a, a han teh a, a dang ang bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vênbûk te, veranda te, chhûng lam pindan bang te pawh a dang tiat vek a ni. Tukverh tê te, ban te, hulhliap te a awm vek a, a thui lam pawh tawng sawmnga, a zau lam tawng sawmhnih leh panga bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chuanhnuai lamah ban a awm bawk a, tûm kûng pawh banah chuan ziak a ni, chhohna rahka chu pariat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hmâr lam aṭanga chuanchung luhnaah chuan min hruai leh a, a teh a, a dang ang bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Vênbûk te, a ban te, hulhliap te, tukverh tête a awm ve vek a, a thui lam tawng sawmnga, a zau lam tawng sawmhnih leh panga bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chuanhnuai lamah ban a awm bawk a, banahte chuan tûm kûng lem ziak a ni a, a chhohna rahka chu pariat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hmâr lam aṭanga chuanchung luhna sîrah chuan in pakhat a awm a, luhna aṭanga kal luh nghâl mai theih a ni, hetah hian hâlral thil hlan tûr an sil ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />He inah hian dawhkân pali a awm a, bang bulah pahnih ve ve a awm a. Inthawinaa hlan tûr, hâl ral tûr emaw, sual thawina tûr emaw, thiam loh inthawina tûr emaw hêng dawhkânah hian an talh ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Pindan pâwn, hmâr lam aṭanga luhna sîrah chuan dawhkân pahnih a awm ve ve bawk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />ran talhna tûr dawhkân chu a vaiin pariat a ni, tualah pali, in chhûngah pali.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hâlral tûr an dahna dawhkân, lungchher kil li nei, tawng khat leh a chanvea inbial, tawng khat leh a chanvea sâng pali in chhûngah chuan a awm a. Ran talhna hmanrua zawng zawng chu hêng lung dawhkânah hian an dah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Lung dawhkân tlâng kawmna, kutphah bênga chhah, a tlângah chuan a awm chhuak a, hetah hian maichâma hlan tûr sa an dah ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chuanchung zâwlah chuan mi hruai chhuak a, hmâr lam aṭanga luhna lamah leh chhim lam aṭanga luhna lamah in a awm ve ve a; pakhat chuan chhim lam a hawi a, pakhat chuan hmâr lam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hmâr lama awm, chhim lam hawi chu, Tempula thawktute awmna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Chhim lama awm, hmâr lam hawi chu maichâma rawngbâwltute awmna a ni, chûng mite chu Zadoka thlahte an ni, Levia thlahte zîngah anni chauh hi a ni Lalpa hmaa kala, rawngbâwl theite chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Chuanchung zâwl chu a teh a, tawng zaa sei, tawng zaa zau a ni a, a inbial a ni; Tempul kawtah chuan maichâm a awm bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tempul pindan hmasaah min hruai leh a, rahka tâwp, chhuah chhohnaah zâwl, tawng ngaa zau a lo awm a, chu chu lehlam lehlamah a kal zêl a. Pindan hmasa luhna bang chu tawng thuma chhah a ni a, bang leh bang inkâr chu tawng sâwm leh pali a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Pindan hmasa chhûng vâng lam chu tawng sâwm leh pahmin a ni a, a dung lam chu tawng sawmhnih a ni. Pindan hmasa tualzâwl chhohna chu rahka sâwm a ni, rahka chhuahah ban a awm ve ve bawk.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlim luhna sîr bang chu tawng ruka chhah ve ve a ni, puan in zau lam tiat a nih chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Luhna bang leh bang inkâr chu tawng sâwma zau a ni a, pindana luhin luhna sîr lam chu tawng nga ve ve a la ni a. Hmun Thianghlim chu a han teh a, tawng sawmli-a sei a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng sawmhnih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pindan chhûngril luh zêlna kawng sîr bang chu tawng hniha chhah a ni a, bang leh bang inkâr chu tawng ruk a ni; luhna bang sîr tuaka pindan bang la awm chu tawng sarih ve ve a nih chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pindan chhûngril chu a han teh a, a dung leh vâng a inchen a, tawng sawmhnih ve ve a ni. ‘Hei hi Hmun Thianghlim Ber chu a ni,’ tiin min hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tempul bang chhah lam chu a han teh a, tawng ruka chhah a ni. Bang ring chuan pâwn lamah pindan, tawng li-a zau a awm tluanchhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng pindan chu chhâwng thuma sânga sak a ni, chhâwng khatah pindan sawmthum zêl a awm a. Tempul bang chu chhâwng tinah a pan hret hret zêl a, in chhâwng chhuat chu Tempul banga va lût lovin a chhawrah chuan a innghat mai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pindan sâng apiang a zau hret hret zêl a ni. Pâwn lam aṭanga en chuan Tempul bang chu a lang zuih chuang lo. Chhâwng hnihnaa lâwn chhohna a awm a, chuta ṭang chuan chhâwng thumnaa lâwn chhohna a awm leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In chhuat chu a pâwng hret a, leia bang innghahna chu tawng ruk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hêng pindan hual hian kawng tawng ngaa zau a awm chhuak a, bang tawng ngaa chhahin a hual chhuak bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />He bang pâwn lamah hian hmun âwl, tawng sawmhniha zau Tempul hual chuan a awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />He hmun âwl aṭang hian chhûng lam luhna tûr kawngka, chhim lam leh hmâr lamah pakhat ve ve a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawthlang lam, Tempul châr lamah chuan, in a awm a, tawng sawmsariha zau, tawng sawmkuaa seia hung a ni, a hungna bang chu tawng ngaa chhah a ni tluanchhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tempul chu a han teh a, tawng zaa sei a ni a, a hnung hmun zâwl leh in awm chu tawng za bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tempul hma lam tual chu a teh a, tawng za a ni. Khawthlang lama hung bâk zâwla in awmte chu a teh a, tawng za bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tempul pindan hmasa te, Hmun Thianghlim te leh Hmun Thianghlim Berte chu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a bang thingphela thuah vek a ni; bangah chuan tukverh lem a khât tâwkin a awm chhuak vek a, luh tirh aṭanga in chhûng chu chhuat aṭanga tukverh lem thleng chuan thingphela thuah chhuah vek a ni. Tukverh tête chu hawn tlang a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kawngka chung lam pawh a chhûng lam leh pâwn lam thuah vek a ni. Pindan chhûng lam thuahna tluan chuan thil lem ker chhuah vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cherub leh tûm kûng lem, inkârthlâk chiata ker chhuah vek a ni. Cherub-te chuan hmai pahnih an nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />mihring hmêl ang chuan tûm kûng lam a hawi a, sakeibaknei hmêl ang chuan lehlama tûm kûng lam a hawi a. Chutiang chuan Tempul chhûng thuahna thingphel chu ker chhuah vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chhuat aṭanga kawngka lu chung thlengin Cherub lem leh tûm kûng lem chu a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlim Ber luhna kawngkhâr ban chu kil li nei a ni a, Luhna bulah chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />maichâm ang thing dawhkân, tawng thuma sâng, tawng hniha zau, tawng hniha sei a awm a; a bang te, a chung te leh a kil ban killi te chu thing vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlim Ber luhna leh hmun thianghlim luhna kawngkhâr chu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />khâr hnih nei ve ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hmun thianghlim Ber kawngkhârah chuan, in chhûng banga ker ang bawk khân cherub lem leh tûm kûng lem a awm a, kawngka lu chung aṭang chuan thingphel zâr a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Luhna bang sîrah chuan tukverh tê a awm bawk a, chumi sîrah chuan tûm kûng lem a awm bawk.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hmâr lam tualah min hruai chhuak a, Tempul huala hmun âwl dung zuia in awmah chuan min hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A dung chu tawng za a ni a, a vâng chu tawng sawmnga a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tempul hual hmun âwl tawng sawmhniha zau aṭanga teh ṭan a ni a, in chuan chuanhnuai zâwk tual thlengin a awh a ni. Chhâwng thum a ni a, a chhawr a awm zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmâr lam hawi pindan kawngkhâr hmaah chuan kalna, tawng sâwma zau a awm a, a thui lam chu tawng za a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pindan hnuai zâwk chu a chhawr a awm avângin a chung zâwk ai chuan a zîm, a chhawr chuan a la hêk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chhâwng thum ni mah se in dangte anga ban a neih loh avângin a bulṭhut pindan ai chuan a chhâwng bangte chu a pan hret hret a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pindan hrûlah, bang tawng sawmngaa sei, tual zau lam depah chuan a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tual zau lam hawi pindante chu tawng sawmnga a ni a, Tempul lam hawi erawh chu tawng za a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuanhnuai tual aṭang chuan khawchhak lam aṭanga pindana luh chhohna kailâwn a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chhim lamah pawh, Tempul huala hmun âwl dung zui bawkin in a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmâr lam ina awm ang bawk kha kalnate a awm a, pindante pawh a intiat a, kawngkhâr te, a rem hmang te, luh chhohna te a inang vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chhim lam hawi kawngka hmaa kal ṭannaah chuan khawchhak lam aṭanga lo luhna kawngka a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi chuan mi bia a, “Hmun zâwl dung zui, chhim leh hmâr lama pindan awmte hi pindan thianghlim an ni: Lalpa hmaa inlan ṭhîn puithiamte chuan inthawina sa thianghlim chu hetah hian an ei tûr a ni. Inthawina thil thianghlim, chhangphut hlan te, sual thawina te, thiam loh thawina te dah khâwmna tûr a ni, Hmun Thianghlim a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Puithiamte chu Hmun Thianghlima an luhin chuanhnuai tualah an chhuak tûr a ni lo, an thawmhnaw chu hlîpin hetah hian an dah zet tûr a ni, an thawmhnawte pawh chu thil thianghlim a ni si a. Mipui awmnaa an chhuah dâwn chuan thawmhnaw dang an inbel tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tempul leh a tual vêl a teh zawh chuan khawchhak aṭanga luhnaah chuan min hruai chhuak a, Tempul ram zauzâwng chu a teh kual ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khawchhak lam bang chu a han teh a, tawng zangaa sei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hmâr lam bang a han teh leh a, tawng zangaa sei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khawthlang lam bang a teh a, tawng zangaa sei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chhim lam bang a han teh leh a, tawng zangaa sei bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A bang kil li chu a teh chhuak a, a bang dung lam te, a vâng lam te tawng zanga ṭheuh a ni; bang chu thianghlim leh thianghlim lo daidangtu a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khawchhak lam aṭanga luhnaah chuan mi hruai leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khawchhak lam aṭangin Lalpa ropuina a lo kal a, a aw chu tuifinriat thâwm ang a ni; a ropuina avâng chuan lei chu a êng pum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Inlârna ka hmuh lan dân chu Jerusalem tichhe tûra P athian inlârna ka hmuh ang leh Kebar lui kama ka hmuh ang kha a ni a, bawkkhupin ka tlu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa ropuina chu khawchhak lam aṭanga luhna kal tlangin Tempul chhûngah chuan a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thlarau chuan min chawi a, chuanchung tualah chuan min hruai a. Ngai teh, Tempul chu Lalpa ropuinain a khat vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka bulah chuan mi pakhat a ding a, Tempul aṭanga lo chhuak aw ka hria a, heti hian mi rawn hrilh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, hei hi ka lalṭhutthlêng ka hûnna leh ka ke nghahchhan awmna chu a ni; ka mi Israel-te zîngah hetah hian ka chêng kumkhua tawh dâwn a ni. Israel chhûngte leh an lalte chuan ka laka uirein ka hmun thianghlim an tibawrhbâng tawh ngai lo vang; pathian dangte hmunsâng angin an lalte ruang phûm nân an hmang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ka tual ânin in an sa a, ka bang bul rêtah ban an phun ṭhîn, an thil tenawm tihte chuan ka hming thianghlim an tibawrhbâng a, ka thin a ur a, ka hrem ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûnah, an uirena chu bânsan sela, an lal ruangte chu la sawn rawh se; tichuan, an zîngah ka awm kumkhua ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Nang, Mihring fapa, Israel chhûngte hnênah ka Tempul sak dân tûr hi sawi la, a len lam leh a rem dân hmang hi hrilh rawh. An thil sual tihte avângin tizak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An sualte avânga zah nachâng an hriat chuan Tempul din dân tûr hi an hnênah hrilh fiah la, a luhna leh a chhuahna te, a len lam te, a zau lam te hrilh rawh; a hman dân tûr te, a chhawr dân tûr te an hmuh atân ziak rawh; tichuan, a awm dân hi an zuia, a hman dân tûr angin an hman theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hei hi Tempul hman dân tûr chu a ni, a tlâng hualin hmun serh a ni a, hman thianghlim a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tawng khat leh kutphah bêng, tawng khata ngaiin maichâm chu hetiang tûr hi a ni. A lei ṭhut chu tawng khata chhah lung rem tûr a ni; a kotlangah khuaptu a awm chhuak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tawng khat chhawrin tawng hniha sâng lung rem chhoh tûr a ni a, heta ṭang hian tawng khat chhawra tawng li-a sâng lung rem chhoh leh tûr a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tawng khat chhawr lehin tap chu tawng li-a sâng rem chhoh leh tûr a ni; tap chu kil li neia rem tûr a ni, kil tinah ki, tawng khata sâng dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tap chu kil li nei tawng sâwm leh pahnih bial tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A chhawr hnuai chu kil li nei, tawng sawm leh pali bial a ni ang a, a tlângah khuaptu, khâp khat a awm chhuak tûr a ni; tapa lâwn chhohna tûr khawchhak lamah kailâwn a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Heti hian min hrilh a: “Mihring fapa, Lalpa P athian -in heti hian a ti: Maichâm in siam hunah heti hian in tuih tûr a ni: Hâlral thilhlan in hlân ang a, thisen chu maichâmah in theh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Puithiam, Levia chi, Zadoka thlahte chauh ka hmaah an lo kal thei ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti. “Sual thawi nâna hlan tûr bâwngtuai pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A thisen chu maichâm tap kil ki pali-ah chuan i tât ang a; a chhawr hual kil tinah leh a tlâng khuaptuah i tât bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sual thawina tûr bâwngchal i la bawk ang a, pâwnah, Tempul tuala hmun ruatah chuan hâl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni hnih ni chuan sual thawina, kêlpa, hmêlhem lo i hlân tûr a ni. A ni lehah chuan kêlpa, hmêlhem lo i la ang a, sual thawi nân i hlân tûr a ni. Bâwng thisena i tih ang bawk khân kêl thisen chuan maichâm chu i tithianghlim tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Chutia maichâm i then zawh chuan bâwngtuai leh ranrual zînga berâmpa i hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa hmaah chûng chu i rawn la ang a, puithiamte chuan chi an al ang a, Lalpa tân an hâl ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ni sarih chhûng chu ni tin sual thawi nân kêl in hlân ang a, bâwngtuai leh ran rual zînga berâm hmêlhem lo in hlân bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Maichâm tuih nân chutiangin ni sarih tih tûr a ni a, chumi zawhah sil fai tûr a ni a; tichuan, maichâm chu a thiang tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chûng hnuah chuan, a ni riat ni aṭangin, puithiamte chuan hâlral leh remna thilhlan te maichâmah chuan an hlân ṭhîn tawh ang; tichuan, kei ka lo lâwm ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khawchhak aṭanga Hmun Thianghlim chuanhnuai luhnaah min hruai leh a, a lo inkhâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan min hrilh a, “Mihring fapa, kawng inkhâr hi a inkhâr reng tûr a ni, hawn tûr a ni lo; tu mah an lût tûr a ni hek lo. Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa chu, hetah hian a lût a, a inkhâr reng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram rorêltu erawh chu veranda-ah hian Lalpa hmaa ruai ei tûrin a kal thei ang a, a lo kalnaah bawk a kîr leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmâr lam aṭanga luhna, Tempul hmaah chuan mi hruai leh a, Tempul chhûng chu Lalpa ropuinain a khat a, bawkkhupin ka tlu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, ngun takin en la, chhinchhiah tlat rawh; i hnêna ka sawi hi ngaithla ngun rawh. Hmun Thianghlim chhûng hman dân tûr te, tu nge lûta chhuak thei tûr te ka hrilh dâwn che hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Hel hmang Israel chhûngte hrilh rawh: Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Israel chhûngte thil tenawm tih hi a tam lutuk ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlimah, ka tân, sa thau leh thisen in rawn hlan pawhin hnam dang, thinlung leh tisaa serh tan lohte in hruai lût a, in tibawrhbâng a, thil tenawm in tih zozai avâng hian ka thuthlung in bawhchhia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hmun in vawng thianghlim lo va, a vawng tûrin hnam dang mi chu in dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: Hnam dang, thinlung leh tisaa serh tan loh rêng rêng ka Hmun Thianghlimah an lût tûr a ni lo; Israel-te zînga chêng ngeite pawh thinlung leh tisaa serh tan lohte chu an lût tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Milem biaa Israel-te an bo lai khân Levia thlahte pawh hian min hlat a, an bawhchhiatna avângin an tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlim thiantu an ni ang a, kawngka an vêng ang. Mipui hâlral thilhlan tûr leh inthawina an lo talhsak ang a, an lo ṭanpui tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipuiin milem an biak lai khân an thilhlante hlansaktu an ni a, Israel chhûngte tân suala tlûkna bulpui an ni a; chuvângin, an chungah ka kut ka lek ta a ni,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti. “An bawhchhiatna avângin an tuar tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Puithiam angin ka bulah an lo kal hnai tûr a ni lo; thil tenawm an tih avângin zah an tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka in vêngtuah leh a chhûnga tih tûr apiang ti tûra tirhkahah ka ruat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Puithiam Levia chi, Zadoka thlahte erawh chuan, Israel-te an bo lai khân ka Hmun Thianghlim an vawng tlat a, anni hi chuan min rawn hnaih thei; ka rawng an bâwl ang a, ka hmaah an ding ang. Sa thau leh thisen ka hnênah an rawn hlan ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Anni chauh hi ka Hmun Thianghlimah an kal thei ang. Ka dawhkân an rawn hnaih ang a, Pathian biak an hruai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tempul chuanchung zâwl an lo luhin la zai sîna siam thawmhnaw an inbel tûr a ni. Chuanchung zâwlah emaw, Tempul chhûngah emaw rawng an bâwlin sahmula siam thawmhnaw an ha tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />La zai sîna siam diar an khim ang a, la zai sîna siam kekawr an ha bawk tûr a ni, an thlan titla thei tûr kâwnghrên an hrêng tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mipui zînga chuanhnuai zâwla an kal dâwn chuan an rawngbâwlna thawmhnaw chu an hlîp ang a, pindan thianghlimah an dah ang a, thawmhnaw dang an inbel tûr a ni; chutilo chu, thawmhnaw thianghlim chu mipuiin an khawih palh ang a, an tuar dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Puithiam chuan an lu an ziat kawlh tûr a ni lo va, an sam an zuah sei lutuk tûr a ni hek lo, an mêt ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hung chhûnga an luh dâwnin puithiam tu mahin uain an in tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />La nula hle mah se, pasal sûn emaw, mâk emaw nupuiah an nei tûr a ni lo; Israel nula hnahkhat chu tu pawh an nei thei ang, puithiam dang thihsan pawh an nei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Puithiamte chuan thil thianghlim leh thianghlim lo te, thiang leh thiang lo te mipui an zirtîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thu buai an rem bawk ṭhîn tûr a ni, ka Dân angin an rem tûr a ni. Ka Dân leh ka thupêkte angin kût nite an hmang tûr a ni a, ka sabat an serh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Mitthi ruang khawihin an intibawlhhlawh tûr a ni lo. An pa te, nu te, unau te, fa te, farnu pasal nei lo te ruang erawh chu an khawih thei ang a; mahse, an bawlhhlawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An inthen fai hnuah ni sarih chhûng an hna an chawlhsan tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chutah, hung chhûng chuanchungnungah an kal ang a, Tempula rawngbâwl an chhunzawm theih nân inthenna thil an hlân tûr a ni,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Puithiamho tân kei hi an chanvo ka ni. Israel zîngah chanvo dang eng mah pêk tûr an ni lo, ka hna hi an chanpual a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Thlai thil hlan te, sual thawina te, thiam loh thawina te puithiam chan tûr a ni. Israel rama thil serh dah hran rêng rêng pawh an ta tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thlai chi tinrêng rah hmasa te leh ka hnêna thil pêk rêng rêng chu puithiam neih tûr a ni. Chhang siam apiangin tlang khat chu puithiam an pe tûr a ni; tichuan, chu mite chhûng chu mal ka sâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sava te, ramsa te, a thisâwn leh sa seh chu puithiamte chuan an ei tûr a ni lo.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ro atân ram in sem dâwnin Lalpa tân Hmun Thianghlim tûr, tawng sînghnih leh sângnga a sei, tawng sînghniha zau ram in serh hrang tûr a ni, chu ram chu ram serh a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />He ram chhûngah hian hmun serh bîk, kil li nei, tawng zanga bial zuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hmun serh pum pui aṭang hian tawng sînghnih leh sângngaa sei, a vâng lam tawng sîngkhat teh chhuak ula, chu chu hmun thianghlim bîk, serh hran tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmun thianghlim bîk a ni a, Hmun Thianghlima Lalpa rawngbâwltu puithiamte tân a ni, an insakna tûr leh biakbûk sakna tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A la bâng, ram tawng sînghnih leh sângngaa sei, tawng sîngkhata zau chu Tempula thawktu Levia chite tân a ni, an nei ang a, hemi chhûngah hian khua an nei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmun serh bulah chuan khawpui tûr ram, tawng sînghnih leh sângngaa sei, a zau lam tawng sângngaa zau teh chhuak ula, chu chu Israel mi zawng zawng tân a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lal tân pawh ram zuah tûr a ni. Hmun Thianghlim aṭangin khaw thlang lamah tuifinriat thleng a ni ang a, khawchhak lamah ram ripui thleng a ni ang a, Israel hnam pakhat tâna ram zuah tiat a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel ramah lal chanvo tûr chu he ram hi a ni ang, mi dang a nêk tûr a ni lo, hemi bâk hi chu Israel miten an nei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Israel hotute u, pâwngnêkna leh innêkchêpna hi bân ngang tawh teh u, dik takin rorêl ula, thil dik ti rawh u, ka mite hi an ram ata nêk chhuak tawh lul suh u,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“In thil tehna chu a dik tûr a ni. Efa dik leh bath dik in hmang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Efa leh bath hi a intluk chiah tûr a ni, a lêt sâwm chu Homer khat a ni ang, Homer hi tehna chhûtna ber tûr a ni ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In bûklung pawh hetiang tûr hi a ni: Gera sawmhnih chu sekel a ni ang a, sekel sawmruk chu mina khat a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In thil hlan dân pawh hetiang tûr hi a ni: Huit chu in thar zât phur sawmruka phur khat, barli pawh phur sawmruka phur khat, hriak chu ṭin zaa ṭin khat in hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In hriak tehna tûr chu bath a ni a, bath sâwm chu Kor khat a ni ang. Kor leh Homer hi a intiat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel rama berâm vulh zahnih zêlah berâm pakhat hlan bawk tûr a ni. Buh te, hâl ral tûr te, remna thilhlan te in hlân tûr a ni; tichuan, in sualte ngaihdam a ni ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ram chhûnga mi zawng zawngin Israel rama rorêltu hnênah hêng thil hi an rawn pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Thla thar kûtah te, sabat ni-ah te leh kût dangah te rorêltu chuan Israel hnam pum aiawhin hâlrala hman tûr ran te, buh hlan tûr te, uain hlan tûr te a tum ang. Israel mipui sual thawi nân, sual thawina te, buh hlan te, hâlral tûr te, inremna inthawinate a hlân tûr a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Thla thar ni hmasa berah berâmpa hmêlhem lo talhin Tempul in thian tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Puithiamin he sual thawina thisen hi a la ang a, Tempul kawngka biangah te, maichâm tap hnuai kil li-ah te, chuanchung veranda kawngka biangah te a tât tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thla thar ni sarih niin thil sual tih palh leh hriat loh vânga thil sual tih palh tân chutiang bawkin in ti leh tûr a ni; chutiang chuan Tempul chu in tithianghlim tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thla thar ni sâwm leh pali ni chuan kalhlên kût in hmang ṭan tûr a ni, ni sarih chhûng chhang dawidim telh loh in ei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kût ṭan tirh niin lal chuan ama sual leh mipui sual thawi nân bâwngla a hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ni sarih chhûng chu ni tin bâwngpa pasarih leh berâmchal pasarih, hmêlhem lo Lalpa hnênah hâl ral atân a hlân tûr a ni a, kêlpa pakhat pawh ni tin sual thawi nân a hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bâwngpa pakhat leh berâm pakhat rual chuan chhangphut efa khat ve ve zêl hlan tel tûr a ni; chhangphut efa khatah hriak hin khat a tel zêl bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Thla sarihna, ni sâwm leh pali ni kûtah pawh ni sarih chhûng chutiang bawk chuan a ti tûr a ni; sual thawina te, hâlral thilhlan te, chhangphut te a hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Hna thawh hun ni ruk chhûng chu khawchhak lam aṭanga chuanchunga luhna chu khâr tûr a ni; a ni sarih ni, sabat ni leh thla thar ni hmasa berah chuan hawn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuanchunga luh tlangnaah lal chu a lût ang a, veranda ban bulah a ding tûr a ni. Hâlral thilhlan leh remna thilhlan a rawn ken chu puithiamhovin an buatsaihsak ang a, veranda aṭang chuan Pathian chibai a bûk tûr a ni; tin, a hawn hnuah pawh tlai thlengin khâr tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram mipuite pawh sabat leh thla thar ni chuan veranda bulah Lalpa hmaah an kûn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sabat nia lalin hâlral thilhlan a rawn lâk chu berâmno hmêlhem lo paruk leh berâmchal hmêlhem lo pakhat a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Berâmchal hlan rualin chhangphut efa khat a hlân tel tûr a ni, berâmno hlan rual erawh chuan a phal zât zât chhangphut a hlân tûr a ni; chhangphut efa khatah hriak hin khat a telh zêl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thla thar ni erawh chuan bâwngtuai pakhat hmêlhem lo, berâm paruk leh berâmchal pakhat, hmêlhem lo hlîr a hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bâwngtuai hlan rual chuan chhangphut efa khat, berâmchal hlan rualin chhangphut efa khat, berâmno hlan rualin chhangphut a neih theih zât zât a hlân ang a, chhangphut efa khat zêlah hriak hin khat a telh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Veranda-a lal a kal chu a lo kalna vêkah a kîr leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Rama mipuiten, hun ruatah, Lalpa hmaa an lo kalin hmâr lam aṭanga luhnaa lo lût chu chhim lamah an chhuak ang a, chhim lam luhnaa lo lût chu hmâr lamah an chhuak tûr a ni, an luhnaah an chhuak leh tûr a ni lo, an kal ngîl mai tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal erawh chu mipui rualin a lo lût ve ang a, a lo luhnaah a kîr leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kût ni leh puipun hunahte chuan bâwngtuai hlan rualin chhangphut efa khat, berâmchal hlan rualin chhangphut efa khat, berâmno hlan rualin chhangphut an duh zât zât, chhangphut efa khatah hriak hin khat zêl nên an rawn hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalin mahni duh thu-a hâlral thilhlan emaw, remna thilhlan emaw Lalpa hnêna a hlan duh chuan khawchhak lam aṭanga luhna chu an hawng ang a, sabat nia tih angin hâlral leh remna thilhlan chu an hlansak ang a; tin, a chhuak ang a, a chhuah hnuah kawng chu an khâr leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Zîngah, tûk tin, berâmno hmêlhem lo, kum khat tling, Lalpa hnêna hâl ral atân hlan ziah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chhangphut efa hmun ruka ṭhena hmun khat leh a hmehna tûr hriak hin hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat tûk tin hlan tel zêl bawk tûr a ni, thupêk angin hei hi tih reng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Berâmno te, chhangphut te leh hriak te hi tûk tin hâl ral atân hlan kumkhua tûr a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Lalin ama ram ro aṭangin a fapa hnênah ram a pêk chuan a fa ta chu a ni ang a, a rochan a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ṭhuihruai zînga mi pakhat hnênah a ram ro aṭangin ram a pêk chuan pêk kîr kumah lal ta a ni leh ang, lal leh a fate chauhvin an nei kumkhua thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lal hian mipui ram ro a lâksak tûr a ni lo, an ram ro aṭangin a hnawt chhuak tûr a ni hek lo. A fate hnêna ram a pêk pawhin ama ram ro aṭangin a pe tûr a ni; tichuan, ka mite hi an ram ro ata an darh tûr a ni lo.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chhim lam aṭanga luhna bula puithiamho awmna pindan thianghlim, hmâr lam hawiah chuan min hruai leh a; chumi bul, khawthlang lama hmun awm chu min entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />He hmun hi puithiamhoten sual thawina leh thiam loh thawina sa thianghlim an chhumna tûr hmun a ni; chhangphut hlante pawh hetah hian an kang tûr a ni. Thil thianghlim rêng rêng chuanhnuai zâwla lâk chhuk tûr a ni lo, mipui a tipawi hlauh dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuanhnuai tualzâwlah min hruai kual a, kil tinah tual hung a awm zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tawng sawmli-a sei, tawng sawmthuma zau, kil tinah chuan hung a awm ṭheuh va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />hungna bang bulah chuan lung an rem chhuak bawk a, thuk atâna rem a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tempul enkawltuten hei hi mipui inthawina sa an chhumsakna tûr hmun a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tempul luhnaah min hruai kîr a; ngai teh, a pindan hmasa hnuai aṭang chuan, Tempul hawi zâwng, khawchhak hawi zâwngin tui a lo luang chhuak a. Tui chu Tempul luhna hnuaiah a luang zêl a; chhim lam, maichâm awmna ding lamah a luang zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmâr lam aṭanga luhnaah mi hruai chhuak a, khawchhak lam aṭanga luhna bulah mi hruai zêl a; ding lam kovah chuan tui chu a lo far a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khawchhak hawiin mi chu a kal a, a hrui ken chuan a han teh a. Tawng sâng a tlin chuan tui chu min daitîr a, kerêk thleng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tawng sâng a han teh leh a, mi daitîr a, khûp thleng a ni; tawng sâng a han teh leh a, kâwng thlengin mi daikaitîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tawng sâng a han teh leh chuan lui lian tak, dai kai rual loh, hleuh kai ngai a lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu mi chuan, “Mihring fapa, hei hi i hmu em?” a ti a. Tichuan, min hruai a, lui kamah chuan min kîrtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaukama ka chhuah chuan vaukam tawnah thing a lo awm khup mai a, ka hnênah, “He lui hi khawchhak lamah a luang a, Jordan phaiah a luang thla a, Tuipui Thi a zu fin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuipui Thia a luan luh chuan a tui al chu a titui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />He lui hi a luanna a piangah rannung chi tinrêng a pung ang a, sangha te a tam êm êm ang. Tuipui Thi tui chu a tithianghlim ang a, thil nung tinrêng an pung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Engedi tui hmun aṭanga Eneglaim tui hmun thlengin tuipui kamah chuan sangha mantute an awm ang a, an lênte an pho vang. Mediteranean tuipuia sangha chi hrang anga tam sangha a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vaukam chirhdûp hmunte leh dîlte erawh chu chia ten atân a la al tho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lui kam tawna thing chi tinrêng chu ei atân a rah ṭhiah ṭhuah ang a, a hnahte chu a vuai ngai lo vang. Thla tin an rah ang a. Tempul aṭanga tui lo chhuak chuan a châwm a, a rahte chu ei atân a ni ang a, a hnahte pawh damna a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Israel hnam sâwm leh pahnihte ram insem dân chu hetiang hi a ni ang: Josefa thlahte chuan chan hnih an chang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In pate hnênah bân phar meuhvin he ram hi in ram rovah pêk ka tiam a, in ro atân insem rawh u le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Hmâr lam ramripui chu Mediteranean Tuipui aṭanga khawchhak lamah Hethlon khaw panin Zedad khaw thlengin a kal ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hamat leh Berotha-ah a kal zêl ang a, Hamat khân leh Damaska inrina Sibraim kal tlangin Hauran ramria Hazer-hatikon thlengin a kal ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, hmâr lam ramri chu Mediteranean Tuipui aṭangin Hazar-enon thlengin a kal a ni; a hmâr lamah Damaska leh Hamat ram a awm a, hei hi hmâr lam ramripui chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khawchhak lam ramri chu Damaska leh Hauran inrina aṭanga chhim lam panin a kal a, Jordan lui a zui a. Khawthlang lam chu Israel ram a ni a, khawchhak lam chu Gilead ram a ni; ri chu Tuipui Thiah Tamar thlengin a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chhim lam ramri chu Tamar aṭangin chhimthlang hawiin a kal a, Kades tui hmun thlengin. Chuta ṭangin hmârthlang lamah Aigupta ramri zuiin Mediteranean a thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khawthlang lam ri chu Mediteranean Tuipui a ni a, hmâr lamah Hamat khua a thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“He ram hi a chi chiin insem rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ṭhum in vâwr ang a, in chan chu kumkhua a in ram tûr a ni. In zînga saphun awm, he rama fa neite pawhin in insem hunah chan an nei ve tûr a ni, mi dang ang bawkin ṭhum vâwrnaah pawh an pawt thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutiang saphun awm vete chuan an awmna hnam ram chan an insem hunah an zîngah an tel ve ang,” Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hmâr lam ramri chu khawthlang Mediteranean Tuipui aṭangin khawchhak lamah Hethlon khaw panin Hamat khuaah a kal a, Enon khua a thleng a, Damaska leh Hamat inrina thlengin a kal a, hmâr lam ramripui aṭang hian a indawtin khawthlang lamah Tuipui aṭanga khawchhak ramripui thlengin an insem tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hmâr berah Dan a awm ang a, Aser-in a dawt ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nafthali-in a dawt leh ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutah Manase-in a dawt leh ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Efraim-in a dawt leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Reuben-in a dawt leh ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Juda a hnuhnûng ber ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Juda dep chhim lamah, mi dang chan zât, ram serh, Tuipui aṭangin khawchhak ramripui thlengin, a zau lam tawng sînghnih leh sângnga zuah tûr a ni, hemi chhûngah hian Tempul a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hemi chhûngah hian Lalpa tân bîk, ram tawng sînghnih leh sangngaa sei, tawng sînghniha zau in zuah tûr a ni. Hemi chhûngah hian Tempul a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puithiamhovin he hmun serh aṭang hian khawchhak lam aṭanga khawthlang lamah tawng sînghnih leh sângngaa sei, chhim lam leh hmâr zâwnga tawng sîngkhata zau an chang ang. Hemi chhûngah hian Tempul a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />He hmun thianghlim hi Zadoka thlahte awmna tûr a ni. Levia thlah dangte chuan Israel-te an sual bo lai khân an zui ve a, anni erawh hi chuan an zui ve lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Levia thlahte awmna depah, hmun thianghlim berah an awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Puithiamho ram chhim lamah Levia thlahte pawhin ram bîk an nei tûr a ni, a dung tawng sînghnih leh sângnga, a vâng tawng sîngkhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hêng ram hi an hralh thei lo vang, ram dang nên an thleng thei lo vang a, mi dang an pe thei hek lo vang, Lalpa tâna serh hran a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />He hmun bîk chhûnga ram la âwl, tawng sînghnih leh sângnga a sei, a zau lam tawng sângnga hi erawh chu serh hran a ni ve lo, a duh duh awmna tûr a ni, ram an nei ang a, an chhawm thei bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A laiah khawpui a awm ang a, kulh kil li nei a ni ang a, tawng sângli leh zanga a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khawpui hual chhuak hian ram ruak, tawng zahnih leh sawmngaa zau zuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khawpui ram zuah hnua ram la chuang, khawchhak zâwnga tawng sîngkhat, khawthlang zâwnga tawng sîngkhat hi khawpui chhûnga awmten huanah an nei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu hnam pawh, khawpui chhûnga awm tawh phawt chuan huan hi an nei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ram lai taka hmun zuah bîk chu kil li bial, tawng sînghnih leh sângnga a ni ang, hemi huam chhûngah hian khawpui chu a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tempul awmna te, puithiam awmna te, Levia chite awmna te leh khawpui awmna khawchhak leh khawthlanga ram la awm chu lal ta tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khawthlang lamah Tuipui, khawchhak lamah khawchhak ramripui thlengin a ta a ni a, hmâr lamah Judai ram a ri a, chhim lamah Benjamin ramri a thleng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />He ram ruat bîk chhim lam hi, Tuipui aṭanga khawchhak ramri thlengin hnam la awmten indawtin an insem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ben jamin hnamin hmun serh chhim lam an chang ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chumi chhim chu Simeon thlahten an chang ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Isakar-in a dawt ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zebulun-in a dawt leh ang a, chhim berah Gad-ho an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Gada thlahte chan chhim lam ri hi ram pum chhim lam ripui a ni nghâl a, Tamar aṭanga chhimthlang hawiin Kades tui hmun thlengin a kal a, chuta ṭangin hmârthlang zâwngin Aigupta ramri a zui zêl a, Mediteranean Tuipui a thleng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel hnam zînga an ram ro tûr sem dân tûr chu khitiang khi a ni, Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jerusalem khuaah luhna kawngka sâwm leh pahnih a awm, khawpui hi kil li nei a ni a, kil khat chu tawng sângli leh zanga zêl a ni. Israel thlahte hnam hming chawiin kawngka hming an phuah a. Hmâr lama kawngka pathum chu Reuben, Juda, Levi an vuah a, khawchhak lama mi chu Josefa, Benjamin, Dan; chhim lama mi chu Simon, Isakar, Zebulun an vuah a, khawthlang lama mi chu Gad Aser, Naftali an vuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kulh bang pum pui sei lam chu tawng sîngkhat leh sângriat a ni. Tûn aṭang chuan he khawpui hmingah, ‘ Lalpa awmna’ tih a ni tawh ang.
  </para>
</usx>
